                <component
                  refId="Package\DQC_DC5\ME13_DECEASED_DQC\ME13_DECEASED_DQC"
                  componentClassID="Microsoft.SSISOracleSrc"
                  contactInfo="Oracle Source;Microsoft Corporation; Microsoft SQL Server; (C) Microsoft Corporation; All Rights Reserved; http://www.microsoft.com/sql/support;1"
                  description="Oracle Source"
                  name="ME13_DECEASED_DQC"
                  usesDispositions="true"
                  version="1">
                  <properties>
                    <property
                      dataType="System.String"
                      description="The name of the table to be fetched."
                      expressionType="Notify"
                      name="TableName"></property>
                    <property
                      dataType="System.String"
                      description="The SQL command to be executed."
                      expressionType="Notify"
                      name="SqlCommand"
                      UITypeEditor="Microsoft.DataTransformationServices.Controls.ModalMultilineStringEditor, Microsoft.DataTransformationServices.Controls, Version=16.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=89845dcd8080cc91">/* =============================================================================
   ME13_DECEASED_DQC_DC5.sql  —  Deceased Customer Files (EIM 242369) Data Quality Checks
   Περιεχόμενο : Όλοι οι πίνακες δεδομένων των φακέλων αποθανόντων (24 πίνακες)
   DC5         : Οι έλεγχοι του DC4 (ME13_DECEASED_DQC_V3.sql), αυτούσιοι, με schema
                 DATACUT5. Το DD είναι ίδιο με το DC4 (v3.0), άρα δεν χρειάστηκαν
                 νέοι έλεγχοι. Νέες στο DC5 είναι μόνο οι στήλες IS_MASKED,
                 DC_Version, Run_Timestamp και οι τύποι NVARCHAR2 του output.
   -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Πηγή πεδίων : 13. 21.1045 242369_ME13_Deceased Customer Files_v1.0_DDAMO_ v3.0_REDACTED.xlsx
                 (+ 01. 21.1289 ME01 DD v1.24 για το HUB_MT_SSCUSTP: ZGDCB, ZGDCS, ZGMDFL)
   Schema      : DATACUT5 (πίνακες χωρίς πρόθεμα: DECEASED, G355SETT, SET*, ...)
   Πλατφόρμα   : Oracle 12.2+ (χρησιμοποιεί TO_DATE ... DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR)
   Έλεγχοι     : 370 έλεγχοι σε 24 πίνακες. Η περιγραφή κάθε ελέγχου είναι
                 στο ME13_DECEASED_DQC_DC5_Check_Catalogue.xlsx.
   Output      : DQ_AREA | DQ_CATEGORY | CHECK_ID | CHECK_NAME | TABLE_NAME |
                 TOTAL_RECORDS | FAILED_RECORDS | DQ_STATUS | IS_MASKED |
                 DC_Version | Run_Timestamp
                 DQ_STATUS: PASS όταν FAILED_RECORDS = 0, αλλιώς FAIL.
                 IS_MASKED: Y όταν τουλάχιστον ένα πεδίο του ελέγχου έχει
                 «Masking Approach» = Yes στο DD v3.0, αλλιώς N.
                 Οι στήλες κειμένου (εκτός IS_MASKED) είναι NVARCHAR2 για τη φόρτωση
                 μέσω SSIS στον ίδιο πίνακα με τα ME01 / ME04 (ίδιοι τύποι και μήκη).
                 (ίδιο σχήμα με τα ME01_HUB_DQC_DC5 / ME04_ATM_DQC_DC5_Unified /
                 ME12_WARNINGS_DQC_DC5)
   ΑΡΧΕΙΑ
   ------
   Ένα αρχείο: οι πίνακες των φακέλων αποθανόντων είναι μικροί.
   ΔΟΜΗ
   ----
   - Κοινές λίστες (πελάτες SSCUSTP, φάκελοι DECEASED) στην αρχή του WITH, με
     το hint MATERIALIZE: υπολογίζονται μία φορά για όλο το script.
   - Μία ενότητα ανά πίνακα. Κάθε πίνακας διαβάζεται ΜΙΑ φορά: όλοι οι έλεγχοί του
     υπολογίζονται ως στήλες σε ένα aggregate (t = πληθυσμός, f = αποτυχίες) και
     μετά γίνονται γραμμές με UNPIVOT. Πάνω από κάθε έλεγχο υπάρχει σχόλιο με το
     CHECK_ID και το όνομά του.
   - Τα διπλότυπα μετριούνται με COUNT(...) OVER (PARTITION BY κλειδί) στο ίδιο
     διάβασμα του πίνακα (χωρίς δεύτερο διάβασμα).
   ΚΑΝΟΝΕΣ ΠΟΥ ΙΣΧΥΟΥΝ ΣΕ ΟΛΟ ΤΟ SCRIPT
   ------------------------------------
   1. Shadow records: οι πίνακες του ME13 δεν έχουν mode flag στο DD, άρα δεν υπάρχει
      εξαίρεση shadow. Το HUB_MT_SSCUSTP φιλτράρεται με NVL(ZGMDFL,' ') &lt;&gt; 'S'.
   2. TOTAL_RECORDS = ο πληθυσμός του ελέγχου (π.χ. μόνο οι συμπληρωμένες τιμές),
      όχι πάντα όλος ο πίνακας.
   3. Ημερομηνίες: όλες είναι κείμενο. Η μορφή κάθε πεδίου είναι αυτή της στήλης
      Field Format του DD:
        - DD/MM/YYYY, με ή χωρίς ώρα (τα περισσότερα πεδία)
        - SDate: DD/MM/YYYY, DD.MM.YYYY ή MM/DD/YYYY (και DD/MM/YY στο CCDdate)
        - DoD: DD/Mmm/YYYY (π.χ. 05/Jan/2020), με NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH
        - λήξη κάρτας: MM/YY ή M/YY, ώρα: hh:mm:ss
        - DECEASED: ημερομηνίες θανάτου / γέννησης σε τρία πεδία
          (ημέρα, μήνας 3 γραμμάτων, έτος YYYY)
      Κενή = TRIM(x) IS NULL. Άκυρη = λάθος μορφή, ή όχι πραγματική ημερομηνία,
      ή πριν το 1900-01-01. Η συνθήκη «έγκυρη» δεν γίνεται ποτέ NULL, ώστε να
      μετριούνται όλες οι άκυρες τιμές.
   4. HUB Customer No (CustNo): μορφή του DD 999-999999 ή 0999-999999. Ο πελάτης
      ψάχνεται στο SSCUSTP ως branch = το πρώτο μέρος, serial = το δεύτερο (ως
      αριθμοί, άρα το μηδενικό μπροστά δεν επηρεάζει).
      Το CustNo είναι masked στο DD σε όλους τους πίνακες: οι έλεγχοι μορφής του,
      «not found in SSCUSTP» και «differs from the deceased file in DECEASED»
      μπορεί να βγουν FAIL λόγω masking (βλ. NOTES στο Check Catalogue).
   5. Αν κάποιος πίνακας ή στήλη του DD δεν υπάρχει στο DATACUT5, το script σταματά
      με ORA-00942 / ORA-00904 και το μήνυμα λέει ποιο αντικείμενο λείπει. Τότε
      σχολίασε τις γραμμές t/f του ελέγχου και τη γραμμή του στο UNPIVOT
      (ή όλη την ενότητα του πίνακα).
   PRE-CHECK (τρέξε μία φορά πριν το script): τύποι πεδίων ημερομηνίας
   --------------------------------------------------------------------
   SELECT table_name, column_name, data_type
     FROM all_tab_columns
    WHERE owner = 'DATACUT5' AND data_type NOT LIKE '%CHAR%'
      AND column_name IN ('SDATE','CREATEDON','DATESETTLED','CHASERDATE','DOD')
    ORDER BY 1, 2
   -- Αναμένεται να μη βγει καμία γραμμή (όλες οι ημερομηνίες είναι κείμενο).
   -- DC5: έτρεξε στις 04/11/2026, καμία γραμμή.
   ============================================================================= */
WITH
  -- Ημερομηνία αναφοράς για τους ελέγχους "στο μέλλον". Για αναπαραγώγιμα αποτελέσματα βάλε την ημερομηνία του Data Cut.
  params AS (SELECT TRUNC(SYSDATE) AS ref_date FROM dual),
  -- Κοινές λίστες: υπολογίζονται ΜΙΑ φορά και τις χρησιμοποιούν όλοι οι έλεγχοι διασύνδεσης.
  -- πελάτες SSCUSTP (ME01)
  k_cus AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ DISTINCT (CASE WHEN VALIDATE_CONVERSION(TRIM("ZGDCB") AS NUMBER) = 1 THEN TO_NUMBER(TRIM("ZGDCB")) END) AS dcb, (CASE WHEN VALIDATE_CONVERSION(TRIM("ZGDCS") AS NUMBER) = 1 THEN TO_NUMBER(TRIM("ZGDCS")) END) AS dcs FROM DATACUT5."HUB_MT_SSCUSTP" WHERE NVL("ZGMDFL",' ') &lt;&gt; 'S'
  ),
  -- φάκελοι DECEASED (SNo)
  k_sno AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ DISTINCT TRIM("SNO") AS sno FROM DATACUT5."DECEASED" WHERE TRIM("SNO") IS NOT NULL
  ),
  -- φάκελοι DECEASED με τον αριθμό πελάτη τους (SNo + CustNo)
  k_dcs AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ DISTINCT TRIM("SNO") AS sno, TRIM("CUSTNO") AS cn FROM DATACUT5."DECEASED" WHERE TRIM("SNO") IS NOT NULL
  ),
  all_checks AS (
/* =============================================================================
   CARDPRODS - Card Products Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."CARDPRODS"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 19
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'CARDPRODS - Card Products Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- CARDPRODS-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- CARDPRODS-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- CARDPRODS-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- CARDPRODS-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- CARDPRODS-005: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- CARDPRODS-006: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- CARDPRODS-007: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: MasterCard Expiry Date (EXP1)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."EXP1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."EXP1"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- CARDPRODS-008: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Visa Classic Expiry Date (EXP2)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."EXP2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."EXP2"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- CARDPRODS-009: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Visa Gold Expiry Date (EXP3)
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."EXP3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."EXP3"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- CARDPRODS-010: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Other Cards Expiry Date (EXP4)
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."EXP4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."EXP4"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- CARDPRODS-011: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s MasterCard Expiry Date (AEXP1)
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."AEXP1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."AEXP1"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- CARDPRODS-012: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s Visa Classic Expiry Date (AEXP2)
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."AEXP2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."AEXP2"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- CARDPRODS-013: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s Visa Gold Expiry Date (AEXP3)
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."AEXP3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."AEXP3"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- CARDPRODS-014: Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s Other Cards Expiry Date (AEXP4)
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."AEXP4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."AEXP4"), '^(0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- CARDPRODS-015: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- CARDPRODS-016: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- CARDPRODS-017: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- CARDPRODS-018: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- CARDPRODS-019: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f19
        FROM DATACUT5."CARDPRODS" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'CARDPRODS-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'CARDPRODS-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'CARDPRODS-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'CARDPRODS-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'CARDPRODS-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'CARDPRODS-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'CARDPRODS-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: MasterCard Expiry Date (EXP1)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'CARDPRODS-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Visa Classic Expiry Date (EXP2)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'CARDPRODS-009|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Visa Gold Expiry Date (EXP3)',
        (t10, f10) AS 'CARDPRODS-010|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Other Cards Expiry Date (EXP4)',
        (t11, f11) AS 'CARDPRODS-011|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s MasterCard Expiry Date (AEXP1)',
        (t12, f12) AS 'CARDPRODS-012|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s Visa Classic Expiry Date (AEXP2)',
        (t13, f13) AS 'CARDPRODS-013|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s Visa Gold Expiry Date (AEXP3)',
        (t14, f14) AS 'CARDPRODS-014|Invalid Dates|Invalid expiry date, not MM/YY: Additional cardholder/s Other Cards Expiry Date (AEXP4)',
        (t15, f15) AS 'CARDPRODS-015|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t16, f16) AS 'CARDPRODS-016|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t17, f17) AS 'CARDPRODS-017|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t18, f18) AS 'CARDPRODS-018|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t19, f19) AS 'CARDPRODS-019|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   COMPSEC - Company Secretary Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."COMPSEC"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 42
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'COMPSEC - Company Secretary Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- COMPSEC-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- COMPSEC-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- COMPSEC-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- COMPSEC-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- COMPSEC-005: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- COMPSEC-006: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- COMPSEC-007: Invalid date: Maturity Date 1 (CCMDATE1)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- COMPSEC-008: Invalid date: Maturity Date 2 (CCMDATE2)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- COMPSEC-009: Invalid date: Maturity Date 3 (CCMDATE3)
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE3"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE3"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- COMPSEC-010: Invalid date: Maturity Date 4 (CCMDATE4)
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE4"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE4"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- COMPSEC-011: Invalid date: Maturity Date 5 (CCMDATE5)
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE5") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE5"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE5"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- COMPSEC-012: Invalid date: Maturity Date 6 (CCMDATE6)
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE6") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE6"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE6"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- COMPSEC-013: Invalid date: Maturity Date 7 (CCMDATE7)
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE7") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE7"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE7"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- COMPSEC-014: Invalid date: Maturity Date 8 (CCMDATE8)
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE8") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE8"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE8"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- COMPSEC-015: Invalid date: Maturity Date 9 (CCMDATE9)
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE9") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE9"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE9"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- COMPSEC-016: Invalid date: Maturity Date 10 (CCMDATE10)
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCMDATE10") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCMDATE10"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCMDATE10"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- COMPSEC-017: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 1 (CCJMDATE1)
          COUNT(*) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- COMPSEC-018: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 2 (CCJMDATE2)
          COUNT(*) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- COMPSEC-019: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 3 (CCJMDATE3)
          COUNT(*) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE3"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE3"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f19,
          -- COMPSEC-020: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 4 (CCJMDATE4)
          COUNT(*) AS t20,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE4"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE4"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f20,
          -- COMPSEC-021: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 5 (CCJMDATE5)
          COUNT(*) AS t21,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE5") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE5"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE5"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f21,
          -- COMPSEC-022: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 6 (CCJMDATE6)
          COUNT(*) AS t22,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE6") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE6"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE6"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f22,
          -- COMPSEC-023: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 7 (CCJMDATE7)
          COUNT(*) AS t23,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE7") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE7"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE7"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f23,
          -- COMPSEC-024: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 8 (CCJMDATE8)
          COUNT(*) AS t24,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE8") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE8"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE8"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f24,
          -- COMPSEC-025: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 9 (CCJMDATE9)
          COUNT(*) AS t25,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE9") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE9"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE9"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f25,
          -- COMPSEC-026: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 10 (CCJMDATE10)
          COUNT(*) AS t26,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCJMDATE10") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE10"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCJMDATE10"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f26,
          -- COMPSEC-027: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 1 (CCWMDATE1)
          COUNT(*) AS t27,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f27,
          -- COMPSEC-028: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 2 (CCWMDATE2)
          COUNT(*) AS t28,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f28,
          -- COMPSEC-029: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 3 (CCWMDATE3)
          COUNT(*) AS t29,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE3"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE3"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f29,
          -- COMPSEC-030: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 4 (CCWMDATE4)
          COUNT(*) AS t30,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE4"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE4"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f30,
          -- COMPSEC-031: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 5 (CCWMDATE5)
          COUNT(*) AS t31,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE5") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE5"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE5"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f31,
          -- COMPSEC-032: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 6 (CCWMDATE6)
          COUNT(*) AS t32,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE6") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE6"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE6"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f32,
          -- COMPSEC-033: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 7 (CCWMDATE7)
          COUNT(*) AS t33,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE7") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE7"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE7"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f33,
          -- COMPSEC-034: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 8 (CCWMDATE8)
          COUNT(*) AS t34,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE8") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE8"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE8"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f34,
          -- COMPSEC-035: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 9 (CCWMDATE9)
          COUNT(*) AS t35,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE9") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE9"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE9"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f35,
          -- COMPSEC-036: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 10 (CCWMDATE10)
          COUNT(*) AS t36,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCWMDATE10") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE10"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CCWMDATE10"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f36,
          -- COMPSEC-037: Invalid date: Confirmation Date (CCDDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t37,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CCDDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CCDDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.]([0-9]{2}|[0-9]{4})$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."CCDDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/RRRR'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."CCDDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/RRRR')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f37,
          -- COMPSEC-038: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t38,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f38,
          -- COMPSEC-039: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t39,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f39,
          -- COMPSEC-040: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t40,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f40,
          -- COMPSEC-041: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t41,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f41,
          -- COMPSEC-042: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t42,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f42
        FROM DATACUT5."COMPSEC" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'COMPSEC-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'COMPSEC-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'COMPSEC-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'COMPSEC-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'COMPSEC-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'COMPSEC-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'COMPSEC-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 1 (CCMDATE1)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'COMPSEC-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 2 (CCMDATE2)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'COMPSEC-009|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 3 (CCMDATE3)',
        (t10, f10) AS 'COMPSEC-010|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 4 (CCMDATE4)',
        (t11, f11) AS 'COMPSEC-011|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 5 (CCMDATE5)',
        (t12, f12) AS 'COMPSEC-012|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 6 (CCMDATE6)',
        (t13, f13) AS 'COMPSEC-013|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 7 (CCMDATE7)',
        (t14, f14) AS 'COMPSEC-014|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 8 (CCMDATE8)',
        (t15, f15) AS 'COMPSEC-015|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 9 (CCMDATE9)',
        (t16, f16) AS 'COMPSEC-016|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 10 (CCMDATE10)',
        (t17, f17) AS 'COMPSEC-017|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 1 (CCJMDATE1)',
        (t18, f18) AS 'COMPSEC-018|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 2 (CCJMDATE2)',
        (t19, f19) AS 'COMPSEC-019|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 3 (CCJMDATE3)',
        (t20, f20) AS 'COMPSEC-020|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 4 (CCJMDATE4)',
        (t21, f21) AS 'COMPSEC-021|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 5 (CCJMDATE5)',
        (t22, f22) AS 'COMPSEC-022|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 6 (CCJMDATE6)',
        (t23, f23) AS 'COMPSEC-023|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 7 (CCJMDATE7)',
        (t24, f24) AS 'COMPSEC-024|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 8 (CCJMDATE8)',
        (t25, f25) AS 'COMPSEC-025|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 9 (CCJMDATE9)',
        (t26, f26) AS 'COMPSEC-026|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 10 (CCJMDATE10)',
        (t27, f27) AS 'COMPSEC-027|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 1 (CCWMDATE1)',
        (t28, f28) AS 'COMPSEC-028|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 2 (CCWMDATE2)',
        (t29, f29) AS 'COMPSEC-029|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 3 (CCWMDATE3)',
        (t30, f30) AS 'COMPSEC-030|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 4 (CCWMDATE4)',
        (t31, f31) AS 'COMPSEC-031|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 5 (CCWMDATE5)',
        (t32, f32) AS 'COMPSEC-032|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 6 (CCWMDATE6)',
        (t33, f33) AS 'COMPSEC-033|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 7 (CCWMDATE7)',
        (t34, f34) AS 'COMPSEC-034|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 8 (CCWMDATE8)',
        (t35, f35) AS 'COMPSEC-035|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 9 (CCWMDATE9)',
        (t36, f36) AS 'COMPSEC-036|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 10 (CCWMDATE10)',
        (t37, f37) AS 'COMPSEC-037|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Confirmation Date (CCDDATE)',
        (t38, f38) AS 'COMPSEC-038|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t39, f39) AS 'COMPSEC-039|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t40, f40) AS 'COMPSEC-040|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t41, f41) AS 'COMPSEC-041|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t42, f42) AS 'COMPSEC-042|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   CUSTODY - Custody Unit Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."CUSTODY"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 41
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'CUSTODY - Custody Unit Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- CUSTODY-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- CUSTODY-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- CUSTODY-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- CUSTODY-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- CUSTODY-005: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- CUSTODY-006: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- CUSTODY-007: Invalid date: Maturity Date 1 (MDATE1)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- CUSTODY-008: Invalid date: Maturity Date 2 (MDATE2)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- CUSTODY-009: Invalid date: Maturity Date 3 (MDATE3)
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE3"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE3"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- CUSTODY-010: Invalid date: Maturity Date 4 (MDATE4)
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE4"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE4"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- CUSTODY-011: Invalid date: Maturity Date 5 (MDATE5)
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE5") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE5"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE5"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- CUSTODY-012: Invalid date: Maturity Date 6 (MDATE6)
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE6") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE6"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE6"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- CUSTODY-013: Invalid date: Maturity Date 7 (MDATE7)
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE7") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE7"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE7"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- CUSTODY-014: Invalid date: Maturity Date 8 (MDATE8)
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE8") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE8"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE8"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- CUSTODY-015: Invalid date: Maturity Date 9 (MDATE9)
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE9") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE9"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE9"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- CUSTODY-016: Invalid date: Maturity Date 10 (MDATE10)
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."MDATE10") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."MDATE10"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."MDATE10"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- CUSTODY-017: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 1 (JMDATE1)
          COUNT(*) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- CUSTODY-018: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 2 (JMDATE2)
          COUNT(*) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- CUSTODY-019: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 3 (JMDATE3)
          COUNT(*) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE3"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE3"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f19,
          -- CUSTODY-020: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 4 (JMDATE4)
          COUNT(*) AS t20,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE4"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE4"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f20,
          -- CUSTODY-021: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 5 (JMDATE5)
          COUNT(*) AS t21,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE5") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE5"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE5"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f21,
          -- CUSTODY-022: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 6 (JMDATE6)
          COUNT(*) AS t22,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE6") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE6"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE6"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f22,
          -- CUSTODY-023: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 7 (JMDATE7)
          COUNT(*) AS t23,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE7") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE7"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE7"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f23,
          -- CUSTODY-024: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 8 (JMDATE8)
          COUNT(*) AS t24,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE8") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE8"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE8"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f24,
          -- CUSTODY-025: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 9 (JMDATE9)
          COUNT(*) AS t25,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE9") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE9"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE9"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f25,
          -- CUSTODY-026: Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 10 (JMDATE10)
          COUNT(*) AS t26,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."JMDATE10") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."JMDATE10"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."JMDATE10"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f26,
          -- CUSTODY-027: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 1 (WMDATE1)
          COUNT(*) AS t27,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f27,
          -- CUSTODY-028: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 2 (WMDATE2)
          COUNT(*) AS t28,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f28,
          -- CUSTODY-029: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 3 (WMDATE3)
          COUNT(*) AS t29,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE3"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE3"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f29,
          -- CUSTODY-030: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 4 (WMDATE4)
          COUNT(*) AS t30,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE4"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE4"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f30,
          -- CUSTODY-031: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 5 (WMDATE5)
          COUNT(*) AS t31,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE5") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE5"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE5"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f31,
          -- CUSTODY-032: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 6 (WMDATE6)
          COUNT(*) AS t32,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE6") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE6"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE6"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f32,
          -- CUSTODY-033: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 7 (WMDATE7)
          COUNT(*) AS t33,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE7") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE7"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE7"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f33,
          -- CUSTODY-034: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 8 (WMDATE8)
          COUNT(*) AS t34,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE8") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE8"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE8"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f34,
          -- CUSTODY-035: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 9 (WMDATE9)
          COUNT(*) AS t35,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE9") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE9"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE9"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f35,
          -- CUSTODY-036: Invalid date: In Widow/Widower's name - Maturity Date 10 (WMDATE10)
          COUNT(*) AS t36,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WMDATE10") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WMDATE10"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WMDATE10"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f36,
          -- CUSTODY-037: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t37,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f37,
          -- CUSTODY-038: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t38,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f38,
          -- CUSTODY-039: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t39,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f39,
          -- CUSTODY-040: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t40,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f40,
          -- CUSTODY-041: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t41,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f41
        FROM DATACUT5."CUSTODY" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'CUSTODY-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'CUSTODY-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'CUSTODY-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'CUSTODY-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'CUSTODY-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'CUSTODY-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'CUSTODY-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 1 (MDATE1)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'CUSTODY-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 2 (MDATE2)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'CUSTODY-009|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 3 (MDATE3)',
        (t10, f10) AS 'CUSTODY-010|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 4 (MDATE4)',
        (t11, f11) AS 'CUSTODY-011|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 5 (MDATE5)',
        (t12, f12) AS 'CUSTODY-012|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 6 (MDATE6)',
        (t13, f13) AS 'CUSTODY-013|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 7 (MDATE7)',
        (t14, f14) AS 'CUSTODY-014|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 8 (MDATE8)',
        (t15, f15) AS 'CUSTODY-015|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 9 (MDATE9)',
        (t16, f16) AS 'CUSTODY-016|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Maturity Date 10 (MDATE10)',
        (t17, f17) AS 'CUSTODY-017|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 1 (JMDATE1)',
        (t18, f18) AS 'CUSTODY-018|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 2 (JMDATE2)',
        (t19, f19) AS 'CUSTODY-019|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 3 (JMDATE3)',
        (t20, f20) AS 'CUSTODY-020|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 4 (JMDATE4)',
        (t21, f21) AS 'CUSTODY-021|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 5 (JMDATE5)',
        (t22, f22) AS 'CUSTODY-022|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 6 (JMDATE6)',
        (t23, f23) AS 'CUSTODY-023|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 7 (JMDATE7)',
        (t24, f24) AS 'CUSTODY-024|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 8 (JMDATE8)',
        (t25, f25) AS 'CUSTODY-025|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 9 (JMDATE9)',
        (t26, f26) AS 'CUSTODY-026|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Joint Names - Maturity Date 10 (JMDATE10)',
        (t27, f27) AS 'CUSTODY-027|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 1 (WMDATE1)',
        (t28, f28) AS 'CUSTODY-028|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 2 (WMDATE2)',
        (t29, f29) AS 'CUSTODY-029|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 3 (WMDATE3)',
        (t30, f30) AS 'CUSTODY-030|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 4 (WMDATE4)',
        (t31, f31) AS 'CUSTODY-031|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 5 (WMDATE5)',
        (t32, f32) AS 'CUSTODY-032|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 6 (WMDATE6)',
        (t33, f33) AS 'CUSTODY-033|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 7 (WMDATE7)',
        (t34, f34) AS 'CUSTODY-034|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 8 (WMDATE8)',
        (t35, f35) AS 'CUSTODY-035|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 9 (WMDATE9)',
        (t36, f36) AS 'CUSTODY-036|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Widow/Widower''s name - Maturity Date 10 (WMDATE10)',
        (t37, f37) AS 'CUSTODY-037|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t38, f38) AS 'CUSTODY-038|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t39, f39) AS 'CUSTODY-039|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t40, f40) AS 'CUSTODY-040|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t41, f41) AS 'CUSTODY-041|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   CHASER - Chaser to Legal Advisor Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."CHASER"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 6
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'CHASER - Chaser to Legal Advisor Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- CHASER-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- CHASER-002: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- CHASER-003: Invalid date: Will date (WILL_DATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."WILL_DATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."WILL_DATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."WILL_DATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- CHASER-004: Invalid date: Sets Chaser Date (COMPUTE_CHASERDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."COMPUTE_CHASERDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."COMPUTE_CHASERDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."COMPUTE_CHASERDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- CHASER-005: Invalid date: Sets Chaser Review Date (COMPUTE_CHASERREVIEWDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."COMPUTE_CHASERREVIEWDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."COMPUTE_CHASERREVIEWDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."COMPUTE_CHASERREVIEWDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- CHASER-006: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f6
        FROM DATACUT5."CHASER" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'CHASER-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'CHASER-002|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'CHASER-003|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Will date (WILL_DATE)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'CHASER-004|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Sets Chaser Date (COMPUTE_CHASERDATE)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'CHASER-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Sets Chaser Review Date (COMPUTE_CHASERREVIEWDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'CHASER-006|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   DECEASED - Deceased Customer Main Document
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."DECEASED"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 28
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'DECEASED - Deceased Customer Main Document' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- DECEASED-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- DECEASED-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- DECEASED-003: Missing Deceased first name or surname (FIRSTNAME/SURNAME)
          COUNT(*) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."FIRSTNAME") IS NULL OR TRIM(t."SURNAME") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- DECEASED-004: Missing ID Card/Passport No (IDNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."IDNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- DECEASED-005: Missing Document Status (STATUS)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."STATUS") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- DECEASED-006: Missing Date of Death (DODdd/DODmm/DODyy)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN NOT (TRIM(t."DODDD") IS NOT NULL OR TRIM(t."DODMM") IS NOT NULL OR TRIM(t."DODYY") IS NOT NULL) THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- DECEASED-007: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- DECEASED-008: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- DECEASED-009: Indicator if File has a chaser not Yes/No (HASCHASER)
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."HASCHASER") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."HASCHASER") NOT IN ('Yes','No') THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- DECEASED-010: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- DECEASED-011: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- DECEASED-012: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- DECEASED-013: Invalid date: Last chaser date (CHASERDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CHASERDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- DECEASED-014: Invalid date: Date of next Chaser Review (CHASERREVIEWDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CHASERREVIEWDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CHASERREVIEWDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CHASERREVIEWDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- DECEASED-015: Invalid date: Date of Death (DODdd/DODmm/DODyy)
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (TRIM(t."DODDD") IS NOT NULL OR TRIM(t."DODMM") IS NOT NULL OR TRIM(t."DODYY") IS NOT NULL) AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- DECEASED-016: Invalid date: Date of Birth (Dobdd/dobmm/dobyy)
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (TRIM(t."DOBDD") IS NOT NULL OR TRIM(t."DOBMM") IS NOT NULL OR TRIM(t."DOBYY") IS NOT NULL) AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- DECEASED-017: Future date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')) &gt; p.ref_date THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- DECEASED-018: Future date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY') &gt; p.ref_date THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- DECEASED-019: Future date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY') &gt; p.ref_date THEN 1 END) AS f19,
          -- DECEASED-020: Future date: Last chaser date (CHASERDATE)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t20,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY') &gt; p.ref_date THEN 1 END) AS f20,
          -- DECEASED-021: Future date: Date of Death (DODdd/DODmm/DODyy)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t21,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH') &gt; p.ref_date THEN 1 END) AS f21,
          -- DECEASED-022: Future date: Date of Birth (Dobdd/dobmm/dobyy)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t22,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH') &gt; p.ref_date THEN 1 END) AS f22,
          -- DECEASED-023: Age at death over 120 years (date of birth vs date of death)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t23,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND MONTHS_BETWEEN(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH')) &gt; 120 * 12 THEN 1 END) AS f23,
          -- DECEASED-024: Duplicate deceased file reference number (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t24,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND t.dup_n &gt; 1 THEN 1 END) AS f24,
          -- DECEASED-025: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t25,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j1.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f25,
          -- DECEASED-026: Date of death before date of birth
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t26,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOBYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH') &lt; TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DOBDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DOBYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH') THEN 1 END) AS f26,
          -- DECEASED-027: Settlement date before file creation date (DATESETTLED &lt; SDATE)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t27,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY') &lt; COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')) THEN 1 END) AS f27,
          -- DECEASED-028: File created before date of death (SDATE &lt; date of death)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS t28,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODDD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODMM"), '^[A-Za-z]{3}$') AND REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DODYY"), '^[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') AND COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')) &lt; TO_DATE(LPAD(TRIM(t."DODDD"), 2, '0') || '/' || TRIM(t."DODMM") || '/' || TRIM(t."DODYY") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH') THEN 1 END) AS f28
        FROM (SELECT x.*, COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY TRIM(x."SNO")) AS dup_n FROM DATACUT5."DECEASED" x) t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j1 ON j1.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j1.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'DECEASED-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'DECEASED-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'DECEASED-003|Missing Data|Missing Deceased first name or surname (FIRSTNAME/SURNAME)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'DECEASED-004|Missing Data|Missing ID Card/Passport No (IDNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'DECEASED-005|Missing Data|Missing Document Status (STATUS)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'DECEASED-006|Missing Data|Missing Date of Death (DODdd/DODmm/DODyy)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'DECEASED-007|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'DECEASED-008|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'DECEASED-009|Invalid Values|Indicator if File has a chaser not Yes/No (HASCHASER)',
        (t10, f10) AS 'DECEASED-010|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t11, f11) AS 'DECEASED-011|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t12, f12) AS 'DECEASED-012|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t13, f13) AS 'DECEASED-013|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Last chaser date (CHASERDATE)',
        (t14, f14) AS 'DECEASED-014|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of next Chaser Review (CHASERREVIEWDATE)',
        (t15, f15) AS 'DECEASED-015|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DODdd/DODmm/DODyy)',
        (t16, f16) AS 'DECEASED-016|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Birth (Dobdd/dobmm/dobyy)',
        (t17, f17) AS 'DECEASED-017|Invalid Dates|Future date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t18, f18) AS 'DECEASED-018|Invalid Dates|Future date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t19, f19) AS 'DECEASED-019|Invalid Dates|Future date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t20, f20) AS 'DECEASED-020|Invalid Dates|Future date: Last chaser date (CHASERDATE)',
        (t21, f21) AS 'DECEASED-021|Invalid Dates|Future date: Date of Death (DODdd/DODmm/DODyy)',
        (t22, f22) AS 'DECEASED-022|Invalid Dates|Future date: Date of Birth (Dobdd/dobmm/dobyy)',
        (t23, f23) AS 'DECEASED-023|Invalid Dates|Age at death over 120 years (date of birth vs date of death)',
        (t24, f24) AS 'DECEASED-024|Duplicates|Duplicate deceased file reference number (SNO)',
        (t25, f25) AS 'DECEASED-025|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t26, f26) AS 'DECEASED-026|Inconsistent Data|Date of death before date of birth',
        (t27, f27) AS 'DECEASED-027|Inconsistent Data|Settlement date before file creation date (DATESETTLED &lt; SDATE)',
        (t28, f28) AS 'DECEASED-028|Inconsistent Data|File created before date of death (SDATE &lt; date of death)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   FUNDMAN - Fund Management Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."FUNDMAN"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 41
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'FUNDMAN - Fund Management Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- FUNDMAN-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- FUNDMAN-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- FUNDMAN-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- FUNDMAN-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- FUNDMAN-005: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- FUNDMAN-006: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- FUNDMAN-007: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 1 (DTO1)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- FUNDMAN-008: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 2 (DTO2)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- FUNDMAN-009: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 3 (DTO3)
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO3") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO3"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO3"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- FUNDMAN-010: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 4 (DTO4)
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO4") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO4"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO4"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- FUNDMAN-011: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 5 (DTO5)
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO5") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO5"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO5"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- FUNDMAN-012: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 6 (DTO6)
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO6") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO6"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO6"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- FUNDMAN-013: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 7 (DTO7)
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO7") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO7"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO7"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- FUNDMAN-014: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 8 (DTO8)
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO8") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO8"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO8"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- FUNDMAN-015: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 9 (DTO9)
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO9") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO9"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO9"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- FUNDMAN-016: Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 10 (DTO10)
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO10") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO10"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO10"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- FUNDMAN-017: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 1 (DTO1_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO1_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO1_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO1_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- FUNDMAN-018: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 2 (DTO2_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO2_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO2_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO2_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- FUNDMAN-019: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 3 (DTO3_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO3_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO3_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO3_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f19,
          -- FUNDMAN-020: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 4 (DTO4_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t20,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO4_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO4_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO4_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f20,
          -- FUNDMAN-021: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 5 (DTO5_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t21,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO5_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO5_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO5_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f21,
          -- FUNDMAN-022: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 6 (DTO6_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t22,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO6_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO6_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO6_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f22,
          -- FUNDMAN-023: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 7 (DTO7_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t23,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO7_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO7_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO7_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f23,
          -- FUNDMAN-024: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 8 (DTO8_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t24,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO8_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO8_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO8_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f24,
          -- FUNDMAN-025: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 9 (DTO9_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t25,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO9_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO9_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO9_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f25,
          -- FUNDMAN-026: Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 10 (DTO10_1)
          COUNT(*) AS t26,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO10_1") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO10_1"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO10_1"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f26,
          -- FUNDMAN-027: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 1 (DTO1_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t27,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO1_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO1_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO1_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f27,
          -- FUNDMAN-028: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 2 (DTO2_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t28,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO2_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO2_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO2_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f28,
          -- FUNDMAN-029: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 3 (DTO3_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t29,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO3_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO3_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO3_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f29,
          -- FUNDMAN-030: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 4 (DTO4_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t30,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO4_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO4_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO4_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f30,
          -- FUNDMAN-031: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 5 (DTO5_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t31,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO5_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO5_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO5_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f31,
          -- FUNDMAN-032: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 6 (DTO6_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t32,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO6_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO6_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO6_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f32,
          -- FUNDMAN-033: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 7 (DTO7_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t33,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO7_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO7_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO7_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f33,
          -- FUNDMAN-034: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 8 (DTO8_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t34,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO8_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO8_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO8_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f34,
          -- FUNDMAN-035: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 9 (DTO9_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t35,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO9_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO9_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO9_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f35,
          -- FUNDMAN-036: Invalid date: Widow/Widower's name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 10 (DTO10_2)
          COUNT(*) AS t36,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DTO10_2") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DTO10_2"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DTO10_2"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f36,
          -- FUNDMAN-037: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t37,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f37,
          -- FUNDMAN-038: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t38,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f38,
          -- FUNDMAN-039: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t39,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f39,
          -- FUNDMAN-040: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t40,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f40,
          -- FUNDMAN-041: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t41,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f41
        FROM DATACUT5."FUNDMAN" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'FUNDMAN-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'FUNDMAN-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'FUNDMAN-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'FUNDMAN-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'FUNDMAN-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'FUNDMAN-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'FUNDMAN-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 1 (DTO1)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'FUNDMAN-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 2 (DTO2)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'FUNDMAN-009|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 3 (DTO3)',
        (t10, f10) AS 'FUNDMAN-010|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 4 (DTO4)',
        (t11, f11) AS 'FUNDMAN-011|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 5 (DTO5)',
        (t12, f12) AS 'FUNDMAN-012|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 6 (DTO6)',
        (t13, f13) AS 'FUNDMAN-013|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 7 (DTO7)',
        (t14, f14) AS 'FUNDMAN-014|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 8 (DTO8)',
        (t15, f15) AS 'FUNDMAN-015|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 9 (DTO9)',
        (t16, f16) AS 'FUNDMAN-016|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date A/C Opened - Investment 10 (DTO10)',
        (t17, f17) AS 'FUNDMAN-017|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 1 (DTO1_1)',
        (t18, f18) AS 'FUNDMAN-018|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 2 (DTO2_1)',
        (t19, f19) AS 'FUNDMAN-019|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 3 (DTO3_1)',
        (t20, f20) AS 'FUNDMAN-020|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 4 (DTO4_1)',
        (t21, f21) AS 'FUNDMAN-021|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 5 (DTO5_1)',
        (t22, f22) AS 'FUNDMAN-022|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 6 (DTO6_1)',
        (t23, f23) AS 'FUNDMAN-023|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 7 (DTO7_1)',
        (t24, f24) AS 'FUNDMAN-024|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 8 (DTO8_1)',
        (t25, f25) AS 'FUNDMAN-025|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 9 (DTO9_1)',
        (t26, f26) AS 'FUNDMAN-026|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: In Joint Names - Date A/C Opened - Investment 10 (DTO10_1)',
        (t27, f27) AS 'FUNDMAN-027|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 1 (DTO1_2)',
        (t28, f28) AS 'FUNDMAN-028|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 2 (DTO2_2)',
        (t29, f29) AS 'FUNDMAN-029|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 3 (DTO3_2)',
        (t30, f30) AS 'FUNDMAN-030|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 4 (DTO4_2)',
        (t31, f31) AS 'FUNDMAN-031|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 5 (DTO5_2)',
        (t32, f32) AS 'FUNDMAN-032|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 6 (DTO6_2)',
        (t33, f33) AS 'FUNDMAN-033|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 7 (DTO7_2)',
        (t34, f34) AS 'FUNDMAN-034|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 8 (DTO8_2)',
        (t35, f35) AS 'FUNDMAN-035|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 9 (DTO9_2)',
        (t36, f36) AS 'FUNDMAN-036|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Widow/Widower''s name - Date A/C Opened - Investment 10 (DTO10_2)',
        (t37, f37) AS 'FUNDMAN-037|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t38, f38) AS 'FUNDMAN-038|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t39, f39) AS 'FUNDMAN-039|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t40, f40) AS 'FUNDMAN-040|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t41, f41) AS 'FUNDMAN-041|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   HELDFUNDS - Funds Held Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."HELDFUNDS"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 13
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'HELDFUNDS - Funds Held Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- HELDFUNDS-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- HELDFUNDS-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- HELDFUNDS-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- HELDFUNDS-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- HELDFUNDS-005: Invalid date: Letter Date (LETTERDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."LETTERDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."LETTERDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."LETTERDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- HELDFUNDS-006: Invalid date: 6 months after Letter Date (LETDT6MTH)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."LETDT6MTH") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."LETDT6MTH"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."LETDT6MTH"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- HELDFUNDS-007: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- HELDFUNDS-008: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- HELDFUNDS-009: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- HELDFUNDS-010: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- HELDFUNDS-011: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- HELDFUNDS-012: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- HELDFUNDS-013: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f13
        FROM DATACUT5."HELDFUNDS" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'HELDFUNDS-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'HELDFUNDS-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'HELDFUNDS-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'HELDFUNDS-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'HELDFUNDS-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Letter Date (LETTERDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'HELDFUNDS-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: 6 months after Letter Date (LETDT6MTH)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'HELDFUNDS-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'HELDFUNDS-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'HELDFUNDS-009|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t10, f10) AS 'HELDFUNDS-010|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t11, f11) AS 'HELDFUNDS-011|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t12, f12) AS 'HELDFUNDS-012|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t13, f13) AS 'HELDFUNDS-013|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   LIFEASSURE - HSBC Life Assurance Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."LIFEASSURE"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 11
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'LIFEASSURE - HSBC Life Assurance Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- LIFEASSURE-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- LIFEASSURE-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- LIFEASSURE-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- LIFEASSURE-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- LIFEASSURE-005: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- LIFEASSURE-006: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- LIFEASSURE-007: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- LIFEASSURE-008: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- LIFEASSURE-009: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- LIFEASSURE-010: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- LIFEASSURE-011: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f11
        FROM DATACUT5."LIFEASSURE" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'LIFEASSURE-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'LIFEASSURE-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'LIFEASSURE-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'LIFEASSURE-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'LIFEASSURE-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'LIFEASSURE-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'LIFEASSURE-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'LIFEASSURE-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'LIFEASSURE-009|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t10, f10) AS 'LIFEASSURE-010|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t11, f11) AS 'LIFEASSURE-011|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   PRIVBILL - Privilege Bill Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."PRIVBILL"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 11
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'PRIVBILL - Privilege Bill Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- PRIVBILL-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- PRIVBILL-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- PRIVBILL-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- PRIVBILL-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- PRIVBILL-005: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- PRIVBILL-006: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- PRIVBILL-007: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- PRIVBILL-008: Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DATESETTLED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."DATESETTLED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- PRIVBILL-009: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- PRIVBILL-010: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- PRIVBILL-011: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f11
        FROM DATACUT5."PRIVBILL" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'PRIVBILL-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'PRIVBILL-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'PRIVBILL-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'PRIVBILL-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'PRIVBILL-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'PRIVBILL-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'PRIVBILL-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'PRIVBILL-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased file was settled (DATESETTLED)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'PRIVBILL-009|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t10, f10) AS 'PRIVBILL-010|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t11, f11) AS 'PRIVBILL-011|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   G355SETT - Settlement Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."G355SETT"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 19
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'G355SETT - Settlement Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- G355SETT-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- G355SETT-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- G355SETT-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- G355SETT-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- G355SETT-005: Indicator if File has a chaser not Yes/No (HASCHASER)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."HASCHASER") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."HASCHASER") NOT IN ('Yes','No') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- G355SETT-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- G355SETT-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- G355SETT-008: Invalid date: G355 received on (G355DT)
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."G355DT") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."G355DT"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."G355DT"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- G355SETT-009: Invalid date: Appointment with heirs fixed for date (APPDT)
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."APPDT") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."APPDT"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."APPDT"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- G355SETT-010: Invalid time, not hh:mm:ss: Appointment with heirs fixed for time (APPTM)
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."APPTM") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."APPTM"), '^([01]?[0-9]|2[0-3]):[0-5][0-9]:[0-5][0-9]$') THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- G355SETT-011: Invalid date: Settlement to be effected not later than date (SETONEMONTH)
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETONEMONTH") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SETONEMONTH"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."SETONEMONTH"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- G355SETT-012: Invalid date: Date File Settled on (COMPLETED)
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."COMPLETED") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."COMPLETED"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."COMPLETED"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- G355SETT-013: Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CREATEDON") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CREATEDON"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- G355SETT-014: Invalid date: Date and time for the appointment to heirs (CALENDATETIME)
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CALENDATETIME") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CALENDATETIME"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CALENDATETIME"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- G355SETT-015: Invalid date: Last chaser date (CHASERDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CHASERDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CHASERDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- G355SETT-016: Invalid date: Date of next Chaser Review (CHASERREVIEWDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CHASERREVIEWDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CHASERREVIEWDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{1,2}/[0-9]{4}( [0-9]{1,2}:[0-9]{2}(:[0-9]{2})?)?$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CHASERREVIEWDATE"), '^[^ ]+') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- G355SETT-017: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- G355SETT-018: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- G355SETT-019: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f19
        FROM DATACUT5."G355SETT" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'G355SETT-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'G355SETT-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'G355SETT-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'G355SETT-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'G355SETT-005|Invalid Values|Indicator if File has a chaser not Yes/No (HASCHASER)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'G355SETT-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'G355SETT-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'G355SETT-008|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: G355 received on (G355DT)',
        (t9, f9) AS 'G355SETT-009|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Appointment with heirs fixed for date (APPDT)',
        (t10, f10) AS 'G355SETT-010|Invalid Values|Invalid time, not hh:mm:ss: Appointment with heirs fixed for time (APPTM)',
        (t11, f11) AS 'G355SETT-011|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Settlement to be effected not later than date (SETONEMONTH)',
        (t12, f12) AS 'G355SETT-012|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date File Settled on (COMPLETED)',
        (t13, f13) AS 'G355SETT-013|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when document was created (CREATEDON)',
        (t14, f14) AS 'G355SETT-014|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date and time for the appointment to heirs (CALENDATETIME)',
        (t15, f15) AS 'G355SETT-015|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Last chaser date (CHASERDATE)',
        (t16, f16) AS 'G355SETT-016|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of next Chaser Review (CHASERREVIEWDATE)',
        (t17, f17) AS 'G355SETT-017|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t18, f18) AS 'G355SETT-018|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t19, f19) AS 'G355SETT-019|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETHEIRLEG - Settlement Details - Heirs/Legal Advisor Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETHEIRLEG"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 9
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETHEIRLEG - Settlement Details - Heirs/Legal Advisor Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETHEIRLEG-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-005: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-006: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-007: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-008: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETHEIRLEG-009: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9
        FROM DATACUT5."SETHEIRLEG" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-005|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-007|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-008|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETHEIRLEG-009|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETCLSDACC - Settlement Details - Details of Closed Accounts
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETCLSDACC"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 10
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETCLSDACC - Settlement Details - Details of Closed Accounts' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETCLSDACC-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETCLSDACC-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETCLSDACC-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETCLSDACC-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETCLSDACC-005: Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") NOT IN ('P','S','W') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETCLSDACC-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETCLSDACC-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETCLSDACC-008: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETCLSDACC-009: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- SETCLSDACC-010: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10
        FROM DATACUT5."SETCLSDACC" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETCLSDACC-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETCLSDACC-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETCLSDACC-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETCLSDACC-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETCLSDACC-005|Invalid Values|Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETCLSDACC-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETCLSDACC-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETCLSDACC-008|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETCLSDACC-009|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t10, f10) AS 'SETCLSDACC-010|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETWDRWACC - Settlement Details - Details of Withdrawal from Account
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETWDRWACC"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 10
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETWDRWACC - Settlement Details - Details of Withdrawal from Account' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETWDRWACC-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETWDRWACC-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETWDRWACC-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETWDRWACC-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETWDRWACC-005: Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") NOT IN ('P','S','W') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETWDRWACC-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETWDRWACC-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETWDRWACC-008: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETWDRWACC-009: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- SETWDRWACC-010: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10
        FROM DATACUT5."SETWDRWACC" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETWDRWACC-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETWDRWACC-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETWDRWACC-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETWDRWACC-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETWDRWACC-005|Invalid Values|Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETWDRWACC-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETWDRWACC-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETWDRWACC-008|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETWDRWACC-009|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t10, f10) AS 'SETWDRWACC-010|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETDEDRETB - Settlement Details - Amount that is being Deducted or Retained by Bank
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETDEDRETB"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 10
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETDEDRETB - Settlement Details - Amount that is being Deducted or Retained by Bank' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETDEDRETB-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETDEDRETB-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETDEDRETB-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETDEDRETB-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETDEDRETB-005: Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") NOT IN ('P','S','W') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETDEDRETB-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETDEDRETB-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETDEDRETB-008: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETDEDRETB-009: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- SETDEDRETB-010: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10
        FROM DATACUT5."SETDEDRETB" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETDEDRETB-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETDEDRETB-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETDEDRETB-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETDEDRETB-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETDEDRETB-005|Invalid Values|Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETDEDRETB-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETDEDRETB-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETDEDRETB-008|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETDEDRETB-009|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t10, f10) AS 'SETDEDRETB-010|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETNOTFEED - Settlement Details - Deducted Notary/Lawyer's fees
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETNOTFEED"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 10
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETNOTFEED - Settlement Details - Deducted Notary/Lawyer''s fees' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETNOTFEED-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETNOTFEED-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETNOTFEED-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETNOTFEED-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETNOTFEED-005: Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") NOT IN ('P','S','W') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETNOTFEED-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETNOTFEED-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETNOTFEED-008: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETNOTFEED-009: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- SETNOTFEED-010: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10
        FROM DATACUT5."SETNOTFEED" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETNOTFEED-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETNOTFEED-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETNOTFEED-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETNOTFEED-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETNOTFEED-005|Invalid Values|Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETNOTFEED-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETNOTFEED-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETNOTFEED-008|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETNOTFEED-009|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t10, f10) AS 'SETNOTFEED-010|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETDEDLEG - Settlement Details - Details of Deducted Legacies
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETDEDLEG"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 10
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETDEDLEG - Settlement Details - Details of Deducted Legacies' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETDEDLEG-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETDEDLEG-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETDEDLEG-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETDEDLEG-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETDEDLEG-005: Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") NOT IN ('P','S','W') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETDEDLEG-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETDEDLEG-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETDEDLEG-008: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETDEDLEG-009: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- SETDEDLEG-010: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10
        FROM DATACUT5."SETDEDLEG" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETDEDLEG-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETDEDLEG-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETDEDLEG-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETDEDLEG-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETDEDLEG-005|Invalid Values|Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETDEDLEG-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETDEDLEG-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETDEDLEG-008|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETDEDLEG-009|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t10, f10) AS 'SETDEDLEG-010|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETFURDED - Settlement Details - Details of Further Deductions
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETFURDED"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 10
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETFURDED - Settlement Details - Details of Further Deductions' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETFURDED-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETFURDED-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETFURDED-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETFURDED-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETFURDED-005: Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") NOT IN ('P','S','W') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETFURDED-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETFURDED-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETFURDED-008: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETFURDED-009: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- SETFURDED-010: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10
        FROM DATACUT5."SETFURDED" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETFURDED-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETFURDED-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETFURDED-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETFURDED-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETFURDED-005|Invalid Values|Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETFURDED-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETFURDED-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETFURDED-008|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETFURDED-009|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t10, f10) AS 'SETFURDED-010|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SETPARTITD - Settlement Details - Partitioning Details
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."SETPARTITD"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 10
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SETPARTITD - Settlement Details - Partitioning Details' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SETPARTITD-001: Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SETPARTITD-002: Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- SETPARTITD-003: File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SNO"), '^[0-9]{1,4}/[0-9]{2}$') THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- SETPARTITD-004: HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND NOT REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- SETPARTITD-005: Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(t."SETTLEMENTTYPE") NOT IN ('P','S','W') THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- SETPARTITD-006: Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SDATE") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '^[0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{1,2}[/.][0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(COALESCE(TO_DATE(REPLACE(TRIM(t."SDATE"), '.', '/') DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/MM/YYYY'), TO_DATE(TRIM(t."SDATE") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'MM/DD/YYYY')), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- SETPARTITD-007: Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."DOD") IS NOT NULL AND NOT (REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."DOD"), '^[0-9]{1,2}/[A-Za-z]{3}/[0-9]{4}$') AND NVL(TO_DATE(TRIM(t."DOD") DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR, 'DD/Mon/YYYY', 'NLS_DATE_LANGUAGE=ENGLISH'), DATE '0001-01-01') &gt;= DATE '1900-01-01') THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- SETPARTITD-008: Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."SNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- SETPARTITD-009: Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') AND j2.dcb IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- SETPARTITD-010: HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(t."CUSTNO") IS NOT NULL AND j1.sno IS NOT NULL AND j3.sno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10
        FROM DATACUT5."SETPARTITD" t
        CROSS JOIN params p
        LEFT JOIN k_sno j1 ON j1.sno = TRIM(t."SNO")
        LEFT JOIN k_cus j2 ON j2.dcb = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^[0-9]+')) END) AND j2.dcs = (CASE WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '^0?[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{6}$') THEN TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR(TRIM(t."CUSTNO"), '[0-9]+$')) END)
        LEFT JOIN k_dcs j3 ON j3.sno = TRIM(t."SNO") AND j3.cn = TRIM(t."CUSTNO")
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SETPARTITD-001|Missing Data|Missing Deceased Customer File Ref Number (SNO)',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SETPARTITD-002|Missing Data|Missing HUB Customer No (CUSTNO)',
        (t3, f3) AS 'SETPARTITD-003|Invalid Values|File reference number not in format 9999/YY (SNO)',
        (t4, f4) AS 'SETPARTITD-004|Invalid Values|HUB customer number not in format 999-999999 / 0999-999999 (CUSTNO)',
        (t5, f5) AS 'SETPARTITD-005|Invalid Values|Settlement Type not P/S/W (SETTLEMENTTYPE)',
        (t6, f6) AS 'SETPARTITD-006|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date when Deceased Customer File was created (SDATE)',
        (t7, f7) AS 'SETPARTITD-007|Invalid Dates|Invalid date: Date of Death (DOD)',
        (t8, f8) AS 'SETPARTITD-008|Missing Links|Deceased file (SNO) not found in DECEASED',
        (t9, f9) AS 'SETPARTITD-009|Missing Links|Customer (CUSTNO) not found in SSCUSTP',
        (t10, f10) AS 'SETPARTITD-010|Inconsistent Data|HUB customer number (CUSTNO) differs from the deceased file in DECEASED (same SNO)'
      ))
    UNION ALL
