                      expressionType="Notify"
                      name="SqlCommand"
                      UITypeEditor="Microsoft.DataTransformationServices.Controls.ModalMultilineStringEditor, Microsoft.DataTransformationServices.Controls, Version=16.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=89845dcd8080cc91">/* =============================================================================
   ME36_TREATS_DQC_DC5_Unified.sql  —  TREATS (EIM 237633) DC5: όλοι οι έλεγχοι
   Περιεχόμενο : Ενιαίο script για το ME36 στο DC5 (500 έλεγχοι σε 25 πίνακες):
                   - 272 έλεγχοι του DC4 (06_ME36_TREATS_DQC_LOAD.sql), ξαναγραμμένοι
                     στη μορφή V3 (βλ. «ΕΛΕΓΧΟΙ ΤΟΥ DC4» παρακάτω), με schema DATACUT5
                   - 228 νέοι έλεγχοι του DC5 (ME36_TREATS_DQC_DC5.sql), αυτούσιοι
                 Αντικαθιστά το να τρέχουν χωριστά τα δύο παραπάνω scripts.
   -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Πηγή πεδίων : 36. 21.1281 237633_ME36_TREATS_v1.0_DDAMO_v2.4_REDACTED.xlsx
                 Όλα τα πεδία των ελέγχων του DC4 υπάρχουν και στο DD v2.4.
   Schema      : DATACUT5 (TREATS_* πίνακες)
   Πλατφόρμα   : Oracle 12.2+ (χρησιμοποιεί VALIDATE_CONVERSION)
   Κατάλογος   : DC4 έλεγχοι -&gt; ME36_TREATS_DQC_DC5_Unified_DC4_Mapping.txt
                 (παλιό TR-* ID -&gt; νέο CHECK_ID, και ποιοι έλεγχοι αφαιρέθηκαν)
                 DC5 έλεγχοι -&gt; ME36_TREATS_DQC_DC5_Check_Catalogue.txt
   Output      : DQ_AREA | DQ_CATEGORY | CHECK_ID | CHECK_NAME | TABLE_NAME |
                 TOTAL_RECORDS | FAILED_RECORDS | DQ_STATUS | IS_MASKED |
                 DC_Version | Run_Timestamp
                 DQ_STATUS: PASS όταν FAILED_RECORDS = 0, αλλιώς FAIL.
                 IS_MASKED: Y όταν τουλάχιστον ένα πεδίο του ελέγχου έχει
                 «Masking Applied» = Yes στο DD v2.4, αλλιώς N.
                 Οι στήλες κειμένου (εκτός IS_MASKED) είναι NVARCHAR2 για τη φόρτωση
                 μέσω SSIS στον ίδιο πίνακα με τα ME01 / ME04 (ίδιοι τύποι και μήκη).
                 (ίδιο σχήμα με τα ME01_HUB_DQC_DC5.sql / ME04_ATM_DQC_DC5_Unified.sql)

   ΕΛΕΓΧΟΙ ΤΟΥ DC4
   ---------------
   Το script του DC4 είχε άλλη μορφή (CHECK_ID | RESULT_NUM | RESULT_TXT |
   EXPECTED, ένα SELECT ανά έλεγχο). Εδώ ξαναγράφτηκε στη μορφή V3: μία ενότητα
   ανά πίνακα, ένα πέρασμα ανά πίνακα, t = πληθυσμός / f = αποτυχίες, UNPIVOT.
   - Η συνθήκη αποτυχίας κάθε ελέγχου είναι ΑΥΤΟΥΣΙΑ του DC4 (π.χ. ημερομηνίες
     εκτός 19900101-20991231, κενή τιμή = αποτυχία). Στα blotters οι συνθήκες
     αντιγράφηκαν αυτόματα από τα CTE t_treats_* του DC4.
   - CHECK_ID: &lt;ΠΙΝΑΚΑΣ&gt;-001, -002, ... Το παλιό ID του DC4 είναι στο τέλος του
     CHECK_NAME σε αγκύλες, π.χ. «[TR-NL-001]». Οι έλεγχοι του DC5 έχουν -501 και
     πάνω (υπάρχοντες πίνακες) ή -001 και πάνω (νέοι πίνακες MMNMBTP, MMZCBTP),
     άρα δεν συγκρούονται.
   - TOTAL_RECORDS = ο πληθυσμός του ελέγχου. Για σύγκριση δύο ημερομηνιών:
     γραμμές όπου υπάρχουν και οι δύο. Για «ενεργά» deals: TxDLST NOT IN
     ('C','D','X'), όπως στο DC4.
   - Αφαιρέθηκαν 47 έλεγχοι του DC4 που δεν είναι έλεγχοι σφαλμάτων:
       TR-RC-001..023  πλήθη γραμμών με EXPECTED από το DC4
       TR-DS-001..008  κατανομές status / product type
       TR-NI-009..010, TR-FX-005/006/009/010, TR-MM-004/005/007/008/010  κατανομές
       TR-ND-001/048/100, TR-RI-002  σκέτα πλήθη γραμμών
       TR-MM-006  ίδιος με τον TR-NL-013 (έγιναν ένας: ISNMMSP-003)
   - Αλλαγές στη λογική (μόνο αυτές):
       * MPMZCPP-005 (TR-DT-012): σύγκριση με params.ref_num αντί για SYSDATE.
       * SEDLSIP-002, DEDLDIP-001, ISNMPCP-001 (TR-RI-003/004/005): σύνδεση με
         TRIM και στις δύο πλευρές, μέσω κοινών λιστών, όπως στους ελέγχους του
         DC5 (στο DC4: απλή ισότητα / NOT EXISTS).
       * Στα ονόματα το «&amp;» έγινε «and» (για να μη ζητά substitution variable).

   ΚΑΝΟΝΕΣ ΠΟΥ ΙΣΧΥΟΥΝ ΣΕ ΟΛΟ ΤΟ SCRIPT
   ------------------------------------
   1. Αν κάποιος πίνακας ή στήλη δεν υπάρχει στο DATACUT5, το script σταματά με
      ORA-00942 / ORA-00904. Τότε σχολίασε τις γραμμές t/f του ελέγχου και τη
      γραμμή του στο UNPIVOT (ή όλη την ενότητα του πίνακα).
   2. Schema: DATACUT5. Αν το DC5 φορτώθηκε σε άλλο schema, κάνε αντικατάσταση
      του "DATACUT5." σε όλο το αρχείο.
   3. Οι πίνακες του ME36 δεν έχουν mode flag στο DD, άρα δεν υπάρχει εξαίρεση shadow.
   4. Στο DD τα blotters έχουν πρόθεμα TEUTTSFP_. Στη βάση: TREATS_&lt;όνομα&gt;.
   5. Οι πίνακες MPESPTP, MPEFWDP, MPMZCPP, ISNMMSP, TTCPIPP, MPMNMCP, MPMSWPP,
      MPRKSFP, DEDLDIP, ISNMPCP, EXBLOTP, FEFWBTP, MMSWBTP έχουν ενότητα και στο
      κομμάτι του DC4 και στο κομμάτι του DC5, άρα διαβάζονται δύο φορές (ίδια
      λογική με το ME04_ATM_DQC_DC5_Unified.sql).
   6. Οι κανόνες του κομματιού του DC5 είναι αυτοί του ME36_TREATS_DQC_DC5.sql
      (ημερομηνίες με VALIDATE_CONVERSION, κενή τιμή = NULL ή 0, κ.λπ.).
   ============================================================================= */
WITH
  -- Ημερομηνία αναφοράς (για αναπαραγώγιμα αποτελέσματα βάλε την ημερομηνία του Data Cut).
  params AS (SELECT TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(TRUNC(SYSDATE), 'YYYYMMDD')) AS ref_num FROM dual),
  -- Κοινές λίστες: υπολογίζονται ΜΙΑ φορά και τις χρησιμοποιούν όλοι οι έλεγχοι διασύνδεσης.
  -- deals Zero Coupon (TREATS_MPMZCPP)
  k_zc_deal AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ DISTINCT TRIM("TGDLNO") AS dlno FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMZCPP"
  ),
  -- deals MCNI (TREATS_MPMNMCP)
  k_mcni_deal AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ DISTINCT TRIM("TYDLNO") AS dlno FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMNMCP"
  ),
  -- security masters (TREATS_ISNMMSP)
  k_sm AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ DISTINCT TRIM("RDSMNO") AS smno FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_ISNMMSP"
  ),
  -- security lines (TREATS_MMNMLNP)
  k_scln AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ DISTINCT TRIM("FYSCLN") AS scln FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MMNMLNP"
  ),
  -- Επιπλέον κοινή λίστα των ελέγχων DC4
  -- deals σε οποιονδήποτε πίνακα deals (FX spot, FX forward, IRS, MCNI, Zero Coupon)
  k_any_deal AS (
    SELECT /*+ MATERIALIZE */ TRIM("TADLNO") AS dlno FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPESPTP"
    UNION SELECT TRIM("TCDLNO") FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPEFWDP"
    UNION SELECT TRIM("T7DLNO") FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMSWPP"
    UNION SELECT dlno FROM k_mcni_deal
    UNION SELECT dlno FROM k_zc_deal
  ),
  all_checks AS (
/* ######################## DC4 ελέγχοι σε μορφή V3 (πεδία επιβεβαιωμένα στο DD v2.4) ######################## */
/* =============================================================================
   MPESPTP - Exchange Spot Deal File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MPESPTP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 11
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-001..003, TR-DT-001..002, TR-NI-003..004,
   TR-FX-001/002/007, TR-RI-001.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MPESPTP - Exchange Spot Deal File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MPESPTP-001: Missing deal number (TADLNO) [TR-NL-001]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TADLNO IS NULL OR TRIM(TADLNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- MPESPTP-002: Missing primary currency (TACYPC) [TR-NL-002]
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TACYPC IS NULL OR TRIM(TACYPC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- MPESPTP-003: Missing counter currency (TACYCC) [TR-NL-003]
          COUNT(*) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TACYCC IS NULL OR TRIM(TACYCC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- MPESPTP-004: Deal date invalid or missing (TADDAT) [TR-DT-001]
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TADDAT IS NULL OR TADDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- MPESPTP-005: Primary currency value date before deal date (TAVDPC &lt; TADDAT) [TR-DT-002]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TAVDPC IS NOT NULL AND TADDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TAVDPC IS NOT NULL AND TADDAT IS NOT NULL AND TAVDPC &lt; TADDAT THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- MPESPTP-006: Primary currency amount zero or negative (TAPCYA) [TR-NI-003]
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TAPCYA IS NULL OR TAPCYA &lt;= 0 THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- MPESPTP-007: Counter currency amount zero or negative (TACCYA) [TR-NI-004]
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TACCYA IS NULL OR TACCYA &lt;= 0 THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- MPESPTP-008: Missing spot rate (TASTOR) [TR-FX-001]
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TASTOR IS NULL OR TASTOR = 0 THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- MPESPTP-009: Same primary and counter currency (TACYPC = TACYCC) [TR-FX-002]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TACYPC IS NOT NULL AND TACYCC IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TACYPC = TACYCC THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- MPESPTP-010: Missing exchange ID (TAEXID) [TR-FX-007]
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TAEXID IS NULL OR TRIM(TAEXID) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- MPESPTP-011: Missing local branch (TALCBN) [TR-RI-001]
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TALCBN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f11
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPESPTP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'MPESPTP-001|Missing Data|Missing deal number (TADLNO) [TR-NL-001]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'MPESPTP-002|Missing Data|Missing primary currency (TACYPC) [TR-NL-002]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'MPESPTP-003|Missing Data|Missing counter currency (TACYCC) [TR-NL-003]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'MPESPTP-004|Invalid Dates|Deal date invalid or missing (TADDAT) [TR-DT-001]',
        (t5, f5) AS 'MPESPTP-005|Inconsistent Data|Primary currency value date before deal date (TAVDPC &lt; TADDAT) [TR-DT-002]',
        (t6, f6) AS 'MPESPTP-006|Invalid Values|Primary currency amount zero or negative (TAPCYA) [TR-NI-003]',
        (t7, f7) AS 'MPESPTP-007|Invalid Values|Counter currency amount zero or negative (TACCYA) [TR-NI-004]',
        (t8, f8) AS 'MPESPTP-008|Missing Data|Missing spot rate (TASTOR) [TR-FX-001]',
        (t9, f9) AS 'MPESPTP-009|Inconsistent Data|Same primary and counter currency (TACYPC = TACYCC) [TR-FX-002]',
        (t10, f10) AS 'MPESPTP-010|Missing Data|Missing exchange ID (TAEXID) [TR-FX-007]',
        (t11, f11) AS 'MPESPTP-011|Missing Data|Missing local branch (TALCBN) [TR-RI-001]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   MPEFWDP - Exchange Forward Deal File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MPEFWDP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 7
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-004, TR-DT-003/010, TR-NI-005, TR-FX-003/004/008.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MPEFWDP - Exchange Forward Deal File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MPEFWDP-001: Missing deal number (TCDLNO) [TR-NL-004]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCDLNO IS NULL OR TRIM(TCDLNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- MPEFWDP-002: Value date before deal date (TCVDPC &lt; TCDDAT) [TR-DT-003]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCVDPC IS NOT NULL AND TCDDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCVDPC IS NOT NULL AND TCDDAT IS NOT NULL AND TCVDPC &lt; TCDDAT THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- MPEFWDP-003: Counter currency value date before primary currency value date (TCVDCC &lt; TCVDPC) [TR-DT-010]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCVDCC IS NOT NULL AND TCVDPC IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCVDCC IS NOT NULL AND TCVDPC IS NOT NULL AND TCVDCC &lt; TCVDPC THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- MPEFWDP-004: Primary currency amount zero or negative (TCPCYA) [TR-NI-005]
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCPCYA IS NULL OR TCPCYA &lt;= 0 THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- MPEFWDP-005: Missing forward rate (TCFTOR) [TR-FX-003]
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCFTOR IS NULL OR TCFTOR = 0 THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- MPEFWDP-006: Same primary and counter currency (TCCYPC = TCCYCC) [TR-FX-004]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCCYPC IS NOT NULL AND TCCYCC IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCCYPC = TCCYCC THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- MPEFWDP-007: Missing maturity code (TCMATC) [TR-FX-008]
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TCMATC IS NULL OR TRIM(TCMATC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f7
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPEFWDP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'MPEFWDP-001|Missing Data|Missing deal number (TCDLNO) [TR-NL-004]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'MPEFWDP-002|Inconsistent Data|Value date before deal date (TCVDPC &lt; TCDDAT) [TR-DT-003]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'MPEFWDP-003|Inconsistent Data|Counter currency value date before primary currency value date (TCVDCC &lt; TCVDPC) [TR-DT-010]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'MPEFWDP-004|Invalid Values|Primary currency amount zero or negative (TCPCYA) [TR-NI-005]',
        (t5, f5) AS 'MPEFWDP-005|Missing Data|Missing forward rate (TCFTOR) [TR-FX-003]',
        (t6, f6) AS 'MPEFWDP-006|Inconsistent Data|Same primary and counter currency (TCCYPC = TCCYCC) [TR-FX-004]',
        (t7, f7) AS 'MPEFWDP-007|Missing Data|Missing maturity code (TCMATC) [TR-FX-008]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   MPMZCPP - Money Market Non-negotiable Zero Coupon Deal Fl
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMZCPP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 9
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-005..006, TR-DT-004/005/012, TR-NI-001..002, TR-MM-001..002.
   «Ενεργό» deal = TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X'), όπως στο DC4 (NULL status δεν
   μετράει ως ενεργό). Το «ληξιπρόθεσμο» (MPMZCPP-005) συγκρίνεται με το
   params.ref_num (στο DC4: SYSDATE).
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MPMZCPP - Money Market Non-negotiable Zero Coupon Deal Fl' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MPMZCPP-001: Missing product currency (TGCCYC) [TR-NL-005]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGCCYC IS NULL OR TRIM(TGCCYC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- MPMZCPP-002: Missing or zero principal (TGPRCP) [TR-NL-006]
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGPRCP IS NULL OR TGPRCP = 0 THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- MPMZCPP-003: Maturity date before value date (TGMDAT &lt; TGVDAT) [TR-DT-004]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGMDAT IS NOT NULL AND TGVDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGMDAT IS NOT NULL AND TGVDAT IS NOT NULL AND TGMDAT &lt; TGVDAT THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- MPMZCPP-004: Active deposit without maturity date (TGDLST, TGMDAT) [TR-DT-005]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') AND TGMDAT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- MPMZCPP-005: Active deposit past maturity date (TGDLST, TGMDAT) [TR-DT-012]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') AND TGMDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') AND TGMDAT IS NOT NULL AND TGMDAT &lt; p.ref_num THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- MPMZCPP-006: Negative principal (TGPRCP) [TR-NI-001]
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGPRCP &lt; 0 THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- MPMZCPP-007: Zero or missing principal on active deposit (TGDLST, TGPRCP) [TR-NI-002]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') THEN 1 END) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') AND (TGPRCP IS NULL OR TGPRCP = 0) THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- MPMZCPP-008: Zero or missing interest rate on active deposit (TGDLST, TGDLIR) [TR-MM-001]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') THEN 1 END) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') AND (TGDLIR IS NULL OR TGDLIR = 0) THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- MPMZCPP-009: Interest rate above 50% (TGDLIR) [TR-MM-002]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLIR IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TGDLIR &gt; 50 THEN 1 END) AS f9
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMZCPP"
        CROSS JOIN params p
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'MPMZCPP-001|Missing Data|Missing product currency (TGCCYC) [TR-NL-005]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'MPMZCPP-002|Missing Data|Missing or zero principal (TGPRCP) [TR-NL-006]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'MPMZCPP-003|Inconsistent Data|Maturity date before value date (TGMDAT &lt; TGVDAT) [TR-DT-004]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'MPMZCPP-004|Missing Data|Active deposit without maturity date (TGDLST, TGMDAT) [TR-DT-005]',
        (t5, f5) AS 'MPMZCPP-005|Inconsistent Data|Active deposit past maturity date (TGDLST, TGMDAT) [TR-DT-012]',
        (t6, f6) AS 'MPMZCPP-006|Invalid Values|Negative principal (TGPRCP) [TR-NI-001]',
        (t7, f7) AS 'MPMZCPP-007|Invalid Values|Zero or missing principal on active deposit (TGDLST, TGPRCP) [TR-NI-002]',
        (t8, f8) AS 'MPMZCPP-008|Invalid Values|Zero or missing interest rate on active deposit (TGDLST, TGDLIR) [TR-MM-001]',
        (t9, f9) AS 'MPMZCPP-009|Invalid Values|Interest rate above 50% (TGDLIR) [TR-MM-002]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   ISNMMSP - Inventory Stock MCNI Security Master File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_ISNMMSP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 6
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-007/008/013/014, TR-DT-008, TR-NI-008, TR-MM-006.
   Τα TR-NL-013 και TR-MM-006 ήταν ο ίδιος έλεγχος· εδώ γίνονται ένας (ISNMMSP-003).
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'ISNMMSP - Inventory Stock MCNI Security Master File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- ISNMMSP-001: Missing security master number (RDSMNO) [TR-NL-007]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDSMNO IS NULL OR TRIM(RDSMNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- ISNMMSP-002: Missing product currency (RDPDCY) [TR-NL-008]
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDPDCY IS NULL OR TRIM(RDPDCY) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- ISNMMSP-003: Missing coupon rate for fixed security (RDFXFG, RDCPRT) [TR-NL-013 = TR-MM-006]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDFXFG = 'Y' THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDFXFG = 'Y' AND (RDCPRT IS NULL OR RDCPRT = 0) THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- ISNMMSP-004: Missing maturity date (RDMDAT) [TR-NL-014]
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDMDAT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- ISNMMSP-005: Maturity date before issue date (RDMDAT &lt; RDIDAT) [TR-DT-008]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDMDAT IS NOT NULL AND RDIDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDMDAT IS NOT NULL AND RDIDAT IS NOT NULL AND RDMDAT &lt; RDIDAT THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- ISNMMSP-006: Total nominal value zero or missing (RDTLNV) [TR-NI-008]
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RDTLNV = 0 OR RDTLNV IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f6
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_ISNMMSP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'ISNMMSP-001|Missing Data|Missing security master number (RDSMNO) [TR-NL-007]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'ISNMMSP-002|Missing Data|Missing product currency (RDPDCY) [TR-NL-008]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'ISNMMSP-003|Missing Data|Missing coupon rate for fixed security (RDFXFG, RDCPRT) [TR-NL-013 = TR-MM-006]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'ISNMMSP-004|Missing Data|Missing maturity date (RDMDAT) [TR-NL-014]',
        (t5, f5) AS 'ISNMMSP-005|Inconsistent Data|Maturity date before issue date (RDMDAT &lt; RDIDAT) [TR-DT-008]',
        (t6, f6) AS 'ISNMMSP-006|Invalid Values|Total nominal value zero or missing (RDTLNV) [TR-NI-008]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   TTCPIPP - Counterparty Information File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_TTCPIPP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 1
   Έλεγχος του DC4: TR-NL-009.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'TTCPIPP - Counterparty Information File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- TTCPIPP-001: Missing counterparty acronym (XJCPAC) [TR-NL-009]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN XJCPAC IS NULL OR TRIM(XJCPAC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_TTCPIPP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'TTCPIPP-001|Missing Data|Missing counterparty acronym (XJCPAC) [TR-NL-009]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   MPMNMCP - Money Market MCNI Deal Master File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMNMCP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 4
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-010, TR-DT-007/011, TR-NI-007.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MPMNMCP - Money Market MCNI Deal Master File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MPMNMCP-001: Missing security number (TYSMNO) [TR-NL-010]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TYSMNO IS NULL OR TRIM(TYSMNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- MPMNMCP-002: Maturity date before issue date (TYMDAT &lt; TYIDAT) [TR-DT-007]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TYMDAT IS NOT NULL AND TYIDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TYMDAT IS NOT NULL AND TYIDAT IS NOT NULL AND TYMDAT &lt; TYIDAT THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- MPMNMCP-003: Value date before deal date (TYVDAT &lt; TYDDAT) [TR-DT-011]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TYVDAT IS NOT NULL AND TYDDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TYVDAT IS NOT NULL AND TYDDAT IS NOT NULL AND TYVDAT &lt; TYDDAT THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- MPMNMCP-004: Nominal value zero or negative (TYNMIN) [TR-NI-007]
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TYNMIN IS NULL OR TYNMIN &lt;= 0 THEN 1 END) AS f4
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMNMCP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'MPMNMCP-001|Missing Data|Missing security number (TYSMNO) [TR-NL-010]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'MPMNMCP-002|Inconsistent Data|Maturity date before issue date (TYMDAT &lt; TYIDAT) [TR-DT-007]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'MPMNMCP-003|Inconsistent Data|Value date before deal date (TYVDAT &lt; TYDDAT) [TR-DT-011]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'MPMNMCP-004|Invalid Values|Nominal value zero or negative (TYNMIN) [TR-NI-007]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   MPMSWPP - Money Market Swap Deal Master File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMSWPP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 4
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-011, TR-DT-006, TR-NI-006, TR-MM-003.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MPMSWPP - Money Market Swap Deal Master File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MPMSWPP-001: Missing or zero principal (T7PRCP) [TR-NL-011]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN T7PRCP IS NULL OR T7PRCP = 0 THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- MPMSWPP-002: Maturity date before value date (T7MDAT &lt; T7VDAT) [TR-DT-006]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN T7MDAT IS NOT NULL AND T7VDAT IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN T7MDAT IS NOT NULL AND T7VDAT IS NOT NULL AND T7MDAT &lt; T7VDAT THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- MPMSWPP-003: Principal zero or negative, pay leg (T7PRCP) [TR-NI-006]
          COUNT(*) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN T7PRCP IS NULL OR T7PRCP &lt;= 0 THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- MPMSWPP-004: Active IRS with zero fixed rate on both legs (T7DLST, T7XRAP, T7XRAR) [TR-MM-003]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN T7DLST NOT IN ('C','D','X') THEN 1 END) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN T7DLST NOT IN ('C','D','X')
                      AND (T7XRAP IS NULL OR T7XRAP = 0) AND (T7XRAR IS NULL OR T7XRAR = 0) THEN 1 END) AS f4
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPMSWPP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'MPMSWPP-001|Missing Data|Missing or zero principal (T7PRCP) [TR-NL-011]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'MPMSWPP-002|Inconsistent Data|Maturity date before value date (T7MDAT &lt; T7VDAT) [TR-DT-006]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'MPMSWPP-003|Invalid Values|Principal zero or negative, pay leg (T7PRCP) [TR-NI-006]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'MPMSWPP-004|Invalid Values|Active IRS with zero fixed rate on both legs (T7DLST, T7XRAP, T7XRAR) [TR-MM-003]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   SEDLSIP - Deal Settlement Instruction File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_SEDLSIP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 2
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-012, TR-RI-003.
   SEDLSIP-002: η σύνδεση γίνεται με TRIM και στις δύο πλευρές, όπως στους
   ελέγχους του DC5 (στο DC4: απλή ισότητα).
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'SEDLSIP - Deal Settlement Instruction File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- SEDLSIP-001: Missing deal number (GGDLNO) [TR-NL-012]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN s.GGDLNO IS NULL OR TRIM(s.GGDLNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- SEDLSIP-002: Deal (GGDLNO) not found in any TREATS deal table (MPESPTP/MPEFWDP/MPMSWPP/MPMNMCP/MPMZCPP) [TR-RI-003]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(s.GGDLNO) IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(s.GGDLNO) IS NOT NULL AND j1.dlno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_SEDLSIP" s
        LEFT JOIN k_any_deal j1 ON j1.dlno = TRIM(s.GGDLNO)
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'SEDLSIP-001|Missing Data|Missing deal number (GGDLNO) [TR-NL-012]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'SEDLSIP-002|Missing Links|Deal (GGDLNO) not found in any TREATS deal table (MPESPTP/MPEFWDP/MPMSWPP/MPMNMCP/MPMZCPP) [TR-RI-003]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   MPRKSFP - Regulatory Key Store Master File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MPRKSFP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 2
   Έλεγχοι του DC4: TR-NL-015, TR-DT-009 (έγκυρο εύρος 20200101-20991231, όπως στο DC4).
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MPRKSFP - Regulatory Key Store Master File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MPRKSFP-001: Missing regulatory key value (RMVALU) [TR-NL-015]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RMVALU IS NULL OR TRIM(RMVALU) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- MPRKSFP-002: Send date invalid or missing, not 20200101-20991231 (RMSDDT) [TR-DT-009]
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN RMSDDT IS NULL OR RMSDDT NOT BETWEEN 20200101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f2
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPRKSFP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'MPRKSFP-001|Missing Data|Missing regulatory key value (RMVALU) [TR-NL-015]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'MPRKSFP-002|Invalid Dates|Send date invalid or missing, not 20200101-20991231 (RMSDDT) [TR-DT-009]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   MPSWSCP - MCNNI Payment/Fixing/Amort Schedule File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MPSWSCP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 1
   Έλεγχος του DC4: TR-MM-009. Το πεδίο T6DLNO (DEAL NUMBER) επιβεβαιώθηκε στο
   DD v2.4, άρα το «[TODO-verify field]» του DC4 δεν ισχύει πια.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MPSWSCP - MCNNI Payment/Fixing/Amort Schedule File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MPSWSCP-001: Missing deal number (T6DLNO) [TR-MM-009]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN T6DLNO IS NULL OR TRIM(T6DLNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_MPSWSCP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'MPSWSCP-001|Missing Data|Missing deal number (T6DLNO) [TR-MM-009]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   DEDLDIP - Deal Delivery Instruction File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_DEDLDIP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 1
   Έλεγχος του DC4: TR-RI-004. Σύνδεση με TRIM (κοινή λίστα k_mcni_deal του DC5).
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'DEDLDIP - Deal Delivery Instruction File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- DEDLDIP-001: Deal (APDLNO) not found in TREATS_MPMNMCP [TR-RI-004]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(s.APDLNO) IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(s.APDLNO) IS NOT NULL AND j1.dlno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_DEDLDIP" s
        LEFT JOIN k_mcni_deal j1 ON j1.dlno = TRIM(s.APDLNO)
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'DEDLDIP-001|Missing Links|Deal (APDLNO) not found in TREATS_MPMNMCP [TR-RI-004]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   ISNMPCP - Inventory Stock MCNI Security Parcel File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_ISNMPCP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 1
   Έλεγχος του DC4: TR-RI-005. Σύνδεση με TRIM (κοινή λίστα k_sm του DC5).
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'ISNMPCP - Inventory Stock MCNI Security Parcel File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- ISNMPCP-001: Security master (RHSMNO) not found in TREATS_ISNMMSP [TR-RI-005]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(s.RHSMNO) IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN TRIM(s.RHSMNO) IS NOT NULL AND j1.smno IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_ISNMPCP" s
        LEFT JOIN k_sm j1 ON j1.smno = TRIM(s.RHSMNO)
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'ISNMPCP-001|Missing Links|Security master (RHSMNO) not found in TREATS_ISNMMSP [TR-RI-005]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   EXBLOTP - Exchange Blotter File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_EXBLOTP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 46
   Έλεγχοι του DC4 (νέοι τύποι deals του DD v2.0): TR-ND-002..047.
   Στο DD ο πίνακας λέγεται "TEUTTSFP_EXBLOTP"· στη βάση TREATS_EXBLOTP.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'EXBLOTP - Exchange Blotter File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- EXBLOTP-001: Missing Country Code (BBCTYC) [TR-ND-002]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCTYC IS NULL OR TRIM(BBCTYC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- EXBLOTP-002: Missing Group Member Abbreviation (BBGMAB) [TR-ND-003]
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBGMAB IS NULL OR TRIM(BBGMAB) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- EXBLOTP-003: Missing Branch Number (BBBRNO) [TR-ND-004]
          COUNT(*) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBBRNO IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- EXBLOTP-004: Missing Dealing Number (BBDLNO) [TR-ND-005]
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBDLNO IS NULL OR TRIM(BBDLNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- EXBLOTP-005: Missing Associated Deal Number (BBASDN) [TR-ND-006]
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBASDN IS NULL OR TRIM(BBASDN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- EXBLOTP-006: Missing Origination of Deal Indicator (BBODIN) [TR-ND-007]
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBODIN IS NULL OR TRIM(BBODIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- EXBLOTP-007: Missing Cancel Flag (BBCNFG) [TR-ND-008]
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCNFG IS NULL OR TRIM(BBCNFG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- EXBLOTP-008: Missing FOS/BOS Message ID (BBMEID) [TR-ND-009]
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBMEID IS NULL OR TRIM(BBMEID) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- EXBLOTP-009: Missing Profit Centre Mnemonic (BBPCTR) [TR-ND-010]
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBPCTR IS NULL OR TRIM(BBPCTR) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- EXBLOTP-010: Missing Sub-Profit Centre (BBSPCT) [TR-ND-011]
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBSPCT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- EXBLOTP-011: Missing Trading Group Identifier (BBTDGP) [TR-ND-012]
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBTDGP IS NULL OR TRIM(BBTDGP) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- EXBLOTP-012: Missing Trading Pool Identifier (BBTDPL) [TR-ND-013]
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBTDPL IS NULL OR TRIM(BBTDPL) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- EXBLOTP-013: Missing Dealing Position Number (BBDPOS) [TR-ND-014]
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBDPOS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- EXBLOTP-014: Missing Account Product Type (BBAPTY) [TR-ND-015]
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBAPTY IS NULL OR TRIM(BBAPTY) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- EXBLOTP-015: Missing Accounting Flag (BBACFG) [TR-ND-016]
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBACFG IS NULL OR TRIM(BBACFG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- EXBLOTP-016: Missing Ext/Int/Retail/Arbitrage Indicator (BBEIRI) [TR-ND-017]
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBEIRI IS NULL OR TRIM(BBEIRI) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- EXBLOTP-017: Missing Counterparty Acronym (BBCPAC) [TR-ND-018]
          COUNT(*) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCPAC IS NULL OR TRIM(BBCPAC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- EXBLOTP-018: Missing GHO Customer Classification (BBGCCL) [TR-ND-019]
          COUNT(*) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBGCCL IS NULL OR TRIM(BBGCCL) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- EXBLOTP-019: Missing Primary Currency (BBCYPC) [TR-ND-020]
          COUNT(*) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYPC IS NULL OR TRIM(BBCYPC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f19,
          -- EXBLOTP-020: Missing Counter Currency (BBCYCC) [TR-ND-021]
          COUNT(*) AS t20,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYCC IS NULL OR TRIM(BBCYCC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f20,
          -- EXBLOTP-021: Missing Primary Currency Exchange Amount (BBCYPE) [TR-ND-022]
          COUNT(*) AS t21,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYPE IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f21,
          -- EXBLOTP-022: Missing Counter Currency Exchange Amount (BBCYCE) [TR-ND-023]
          COUNT(*) AS t22,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYCE IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f22,
          -- EXBLOTP-023: Missing Currenct Spot Revaluation in USD equivalent (BBCYPL) [TR-ND-024]
          COUNT(*) AS t23,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYPL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f23,
          -- EXBLOTP-024: Missing Current Total Notional Rollover Cost in USD equiv (BBCYCL) [TR-ND-025]
          COUNT(*) AS t24,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYCL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f24,
          -- EXBLOTP-025: Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Spot Equiv. Rate (BBPCCS) [TR-ND-026]
          COUNT(*) AS t25,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBPCCS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f25,
          -- EXBLOTP-026: Missing Rollover Swap Points (BBRSPT) [TR-ND-027]
          COUNT(*) AS t26,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBRSPT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f26,
          -- EXBLOTP-027: Missing Rollover Swap Period (BBRSWP) [TR-ND-028]
          COUNT(*) AS t27,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBRSWP IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f27,
          -- EXBLOTP-028: Missing Rate Sense (BBRSNS) [TR-ND-029]
          COUNT(*) AS t28,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBRSNS IS NULL OR TRIM(BBRSNS) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f28,
          -- EXBLOTP-029: Missing Current Spot Revaluation (BBCEPL) [TR-ND-030]
          COUNT(*) AS t29,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCEPL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f29,
          -- EXBLOTP-030: Missing Current Total Amortisation of Rollover Swap Int (BBCRSI) [TR-ND-031]
          COUNT(*) AS t30,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCRSI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f30,
          -- EXBLOTP-031: Missing Current Total Notional Rollover Cost (BBCNRC) [TR-ND-032]
          COUNT(*) AS t31,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCNRC IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f31,
          -- EXBLOTP-032: Missing Current Total Funding Cost on Provision (BBCCOF) [TR-ND-033]
          COUNT(*) AS t32,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCCOF IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f32,
          -- EXBLOTP-033: Missing Previous Spot Revaluation (BBPEPL) [TR-ND-034]
          COUNT(*) AS t33,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBPEPL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f33,
          -- EXBLOTP-034: Missing Previous Total Amortisation of Rollover Swap Int (BBPRSI) [TR-ND-035]
          COUNT(*) AS t34,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBPRSI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f34,
          -- EXBLOTP-035: Missing Previous Total Notional Rollover Cost (BBPNRC) [TR-ND-036]
          COUNT(*) AS t35,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBPNRC IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f35,
          -- EXBLOTP-036: Missing Previous Total Funding Cost on Provision (BBPCOF) [TR-ND-037]
          COUNT(*) AS t36,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBPCOF IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f36,
          -- EXBLOTP-037: Missing Money Market Forward Flag (BBMMKF) [TR-ND-038]
          COUNT(*) AS t37,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBMMKF IS NULL OR TRIM(BBMMKF) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f37,
          -- EXBLOTP-038: Missing Primary Currency Discounted Amount (BBPVPA) [TR-ND-039]
          COUNT(*) AS t38,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBPVPA IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f38,
          -- EXBLOTP-039: Missing Counter Currency Discounted Amount (BBCVCA) [TR-ND-040]
          COUNT(*) AS t39,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCVCA IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f39,
          -- EXBLOTP-040: Missing Customer Margin (BBCMGN) [TR-ND-041]
          COUNT(*) AS t40,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCMGN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f40,
          -- EXBLOTP-041: Invalid/Missing Capture Date (BBCDAT) [TR-ND-042]
          COUNT(*) AS t41,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCDAT IS NULL OR BBCDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f41,
          -- EXBLOTP-042: Invalid/Missing Deal Date (BBDDAT) [TR-ND-043]
          COUNT(*) AS t42,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBDDAT IS NULL OR BBDDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f42,
          -- EXBLOTP-043: Invalid/Missing Ladder Value Date (BBLDAT) [TR-ND-044]
          COUNT(*) AS t43,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBLDAT IS NULL OR BBLDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f43,
          -- EXBLOTP-044: Invalid/Missing Option End Date (BBEDAT) [TR-ND-045]
          COUNT(*) AS t44,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBEDAT IS NULL OR BBEDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f44,
          -- EXBLOTP-045: Invalid/Missing Spot Date of Contract (BBSPTD) [TR-ND-046]
          COUNT(*) AS t45,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBSPTD IS NULL OR BBSPTD NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f45,
          -- EXBLOTP-046: Same primary and counter currency (BBCYPC = BBCYCC) [TR-ND-047]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYPC IS NOT NULL AND BBCYCC IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t46,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN BBCYPC = BBCYCC THEN 1 END) AS f46
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_EXBLOTP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'EXBLOTP-001|Missing Data|Missing Country Code (BBCTYC) [TR-ND-002]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'EXBLOTP-002|Missing Data|Missing Group Member Abbreviation (BBGMAB) [TR-ND-003]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'EXBLOTP-003|Missing Data|Missing Branch Number (BBBRNO) [TR-ND-004]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'EXBLOTP-004|Missing Data|Missing Dealing Number (BBDLNO) [TR-ND-005]',
        (t5, f5) AS 'EXBLOTP-005|Missing Data|Missing Associated Deal Number (BBASDN) [TR-ND-006]',
        (t6, f6) AS 'EXBLOTP-006|Missing Data|Missing Origination of Deal Indicator (BBODIN) [TR-ND-007]',
        (t7, f7) AS 'EXBLOTP-007|Missing Data|Missing Cancel Flag (BBCNFG) [TR-ND-008]',
        (t8, f8) AS 'EXBLOTP-008|Missing Data|Missing FOS/BOS Message ID (BBMEID) [TR-ND-009]',
        (t9, f9) AS 'EXBLOTP-009|Missing Data|Missing Profit Centre Mnemonic (BBPCTR) [TR-ND-010]',
        (t10, f10) AS 'EXBLOTP-010|Missing Data|Missing Sub-Profit Centre (BBSPCT) [TR-ND-011]',
        (t11, f11) AS 'EXBLOTP-011|Missing Data|Missing Trading Group Identifier (BBTDGP) [TR-ND-012]',
        (t12, f12) AS 'EXBLOTP-012|Missing Data|Missing Trading Pool Identifier (BBTDPL) [TR-ND-013]',
        (t13, f13) AS 'EXBLOTP-013|Missing Data|Missing Dealing Position Number (BBDPOS) [TR-ND-014]',
        (t14, f14) AS 'EXBLOTP-014|Missing Data|Missing Account Product Type (BBAPTY) [TR-ND-015]',
        (t15, f15) AS 'EXBLOTP-015|Missing Data|Missing Accounting Flag (BBACFG) [TR-ND-016]',
        (t16, f16) AS 'EXBLOTP-016|Missing Data|Missing Ext/Int/Retail/Arbitrage Indicator (BBEIRI) [TR-ND-017]',
        (t17, f17) AS 'EXBLOTP-017|Missing Data|Missing Counterparty Acronym (BBCPAC) [TR-ND-018]',
        (t18, f18) AS 'EXBLOTP-018|Missing Data|Missing GHO Customer Classification (BBGCCL) [TR-ND-019]',
        (t19, f19) AS 'EXBLOTP-019|Missing Data|Missing Primary Currency (BBCYPC) [TR-ND-020]',
        (t20, f20) AS 'EXBLOTP-020|Missing Data|Missing Counter Currency (BBCYCC) [TR-ND-021]',
        (t21, f21) AS 'EXBLOTP-021|Missing Data|Missing Primary Currency Exchange Amount (BBCYPE) [TR-ND-022]',
        (t22, f22) AS 'EXBLOTP-022|Missing Data|Missing Counter Currency Exchange Amount (BBCYCE) [TR-ND-023]',
        (t23, f23) AS 'EXBLOTP-023|Missing Data|Missing Currenct Spot Revaluation in USD equivalent (BBCYPL) [TR-ND-024]',
        (t24, f24) AS 'EXBLOTP-024|Missing Data|Missing Current Total Notional Rollover Cost in USD equiv (BBCYCL) [TR-ND-025]',
        (t25, f25) AS 'EXBLOTP-025|Missing Data|Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Spot Equiv. Rate (BBPCCS) [TR-ND-026]',
        (t26, f26) AS 'EXBLOTP-026|Missing Data|Missing Rollover Swap Points (BBRSPT) [TR-ND-027]',
        (t27, f27) AS 'EXBLOTP-027|Missing Data|Missing Rollover Swap Period (BBRSWP) [TR-ND-028]',
        (t28, f28) AS 'EXBLOTP-028|Missing Data|Missing Rate Sense (BBRSNS) [TR-ND-029]',
        (t29, f29) AS 'EXBLOTP-029|Missing Data|Missing Current Spot Revaluation (BBCEPL) [TR-ND-030]',
        (t30, f30) AS 'EXBLOTP-030|Missing Data|Missing Current Total Amortisation of Rollover Swap Int (BBCRSI) [TR-ND-031]',
        (t31, f31) AS 'EXBLOTP-031|Missing Data|Missing Current Total Notional Rollover Cost (BBCNRC) [TR-ND-032]',
        (t32, f32) AS 'EXBLOTP-032|Missing Data|Missing Current Total Funding Cost on Provision (BBCCOF) [TR-ND-033]',
        (t33, f33) AS 'EXBLOTP-033|Missing Data|Missing Previous Spot Revaluation (BBPEPL) [TR-ND-034]',
        (t34, f34) AS 'EXBLOTP-034|Missing Data|Missing Previous Total Amortisation of Rollover Swap Int (BBPRSI) [TR-ND-035]',
        (t35, f35) AS 'EXBLOTP-035|Missing Data|Missing Previous Total Notional Rollover Cost (BBPNRC) [TR-ND-036]',
        (t36, f36) AS 'EXBLOTP-036|Missing Data|Missing Previous Total Funding Cost on Provision (BBPCOF) [TR-ND-037]',
        (t37, f37) AS 'EXBLOTP-037|Missing Data|Missing Money Market Forward Flag (BBMMKF) [TR-ND-038]',
        (t38, f38) AS 'EXBLOTP-038|Missing Data|Missing Primary Currency Discounted Amount (BBPVPA) [TR-ND-039]',
        (t39, f39) AS 'EXBLOTP-039|Missing Data|Missing Counter Currency Discounted Amount (BBCVCA) [TR-ND-040]',
        (t40, f40) AS 'EXBLOTP-040|Missing Data|Missing Customer Margin (BBCMGN) [TR-ND-041]',
        (t41, f41) AS 'EXBLOTP-041|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Capture Date (BBCDAT) [TR-ND-042]',
        (t42, f42) AS 'EXBLOTP-042|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Deal Date (BBDDAT) [TR-ND-043]',
        (t43, f43) AS 'EXBLOTP-043|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Ladder Value Date (BBLDAT) [TR-ND-044]',
        (t44, f44) AS 'EXBLOTP-044|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Option End Date (BBEDAT) [TR-ND-045]',
        (t45, f45) AS 'EXBLOTP-045|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Spot Date of Contract (BBSPTD) [TR-ND-046]',
        (t46, f46) AS 'EXBLOTP-046|Inconsistent Data|Same primary and counter currency (BBCYPC = BBCYCC) [TR-ND-047]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   FEFWBTP - Forward Blotter File
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_FEFWBTP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 51
   Έλεγχοι του DC4 (νέοι τύποι deals του DD v2.0): TR-ND-049..099.
   Στο DD ο πίνακας λέγεται "TEUTTSFP_FEFWBTP"· στη βάση TREATS_FEFWBTP.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'FEFWBTP - Forward Blotter File' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- FEFWBTP-001: Missing Country Code (EBCTYC) [TR-ND-049]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCTYC IS NULL OR TRIM(EBCTYC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- FEFWBTP-002: Missing Group Member Abbreviation (EBGMAB) [TR-ND-050]
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBGMAB IS NULL OR TRIM(EBGMAB) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- FEFWBTP-003: Missing Branch Number (EBBRNO) [TR-ND-051]
          COUNT(*) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBBRNO IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- FEFWBTP-004: Missing Dealing Number (EBDLNO) [TR-ND-052]
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBDLNO IS NULL OR TRIM(EBDLNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- FEFWBTP-005: Missing Associated Deal Number (EBASDN) [TR-ND-053]
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBASDN IS NULL OR TRIM(EBASDN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- FEFWBTP-006: Missing Origination of Deal Indicator (EBODIN) [TR-ND-054]
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBODIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EBODIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- FEFWBTP-007: Missing Cancel Flag (EBCNFG) [TR-ND-055]
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCNFG IS NULL OR TRIM(EBCNFG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- FEFWBTP-008: Missing Profit Centre Mnemonic (EBPCTR) [TR-ND-056]
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPCTR IS NULL OR TRIM(EBPCTR) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- FEFWBTP-009: Missing Sub-Profit Centre (EBSPCT) [TR-ND-057]
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBSPCT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- FEFWBTP-010: Missing Trading Group Identifier (EBTDGP) [TR-ND-058]
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBTDGP IS NULL OR TRIM(EBTDGP) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- FEFWBTP-011: Missing Trading Pool Identifier (EBTDPL) [TR-ND-059]
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBTDPL IS NULL OR TRIM(EBTDPL) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- FEFWBTP-012: Missing Dealing Position Number (EBDPOS) [TR-ND-060]
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBDPOS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- FEFWBTP-013: Missing Account Product Type (EBAPTY) [TR-ND-061]
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBAPTY IS NULL OR TRIM(EBAPTY) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- FEFWBTP-014: Missing Accounting Flag (EBACFG) [TR-ND-062]
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBACFG IS NULL OR TRIM(EBACFG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- FEFWBTP-015: Missing Ext/Int/Retail/Arbitrage Indicator (EBEIRI) [TR-ND-063]
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBEIRI IS NULL OR TRIM(EBEIRI) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- FEFWBTP-016: Missing Counterparty Acronym (EBCPAC) [TR-ND-064]
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCPAC IS NULL OR TRIM(EBCPAC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- FEFWBTP-017: Missing GHO Customer Classification (EBGCCL) [TR-ND-065]
          COUNT(*) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBGCCL IS NULL OR TRIM(EBGCCL) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- FEFWBTP-018: Missing Primary Currency (EBCYPC) [TR-ND-066]
          COUNT(*) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCYPC IS NULL OR TRIM(EBCYPC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- FEFWBTP-019: Missing Counter Currency (EBCYCC) [TR-ND-067]
          COUNT(*) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCYCC IS NULL OR TRIM(EBCYCC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f19,
          -- FEFWBTP-020: Missing Primary Currency Contract Amount (EBPCYA) [TR-ND-068]
          COUNT(*) AS t20,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPCYA IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f20,
          -- FEFWBTP-021: Missing Counter Currency Contract Amount (EBCCYA) [TR-ND-069]
          COUNT(*) AS t21,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCCYA IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f21,
          -- FEFWBTP-022: Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Spot Equiv. Rate (EBPCCS) [TR-ND-070]
          COUNT(*) AS t22,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPCCS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f22,
          -- FEFWBTP-023: Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Swap Points (EBPCSS) [TR-ND-071]
          COUNT(*) AS t23,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPCSS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f23,
          -- FEFWBTP-024: Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Swap Points from (EBPCSE) [TR-ND-072]
          COUNT(*) AS t24,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPCSE IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f24,
          -- FEFWBTP-025: Missing Primary Currency Contract Interest Rate (EBPCYI) [TR-ND-073]
          COUNT(*) AS t25,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPCYI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f25,
          -- FEFWBTP-026: Missing Counter Currency Contract Interest Rate (EBCCYI) [TR-ND-074]
          COUNT(*) AS t26,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCCYI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f26,
          -- FEFWBTP-027: Missing Primary Currency Discounted Amount (EBPCYD) [TR-ND-075]
          COUNT(*) AS t27,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPCYD IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f27,
          -- FEFWBTP-028: Missing Counter Currency Discounted Amount (EBCCYD) [TR-ND-076]
          COUNT(*) AS t28,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCCYD IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f28,
          -- FEFWBTP-029: Missing Rate Sense (EBRSNS) [TR-ND-077]
          COUNT(*) AS t29,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBRSNS IS NULL OR TRIM(EBRSNS) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f29,
          -- FEFWBTP-030: Missing Current change in Premium/Discount (EBCPDS) [TR-ND-078]
          COUNT(*) AS t30,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCPDS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f30,
          -- FEFWBTP-031: Missing Current NPV of change in Premium/Discount (EBCPDI) [TR-ND-079]
          COUNT(*) AS t31,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCPDI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f31,
          -- FEFWBTP-032: Missing Current Mark-to-market interest costs (EBCMMI) [TR-ND-080]
          COUNT(*) AS t32,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCMMI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f32,
          -- FEFWBTP-033: Missing Current NPV of Mark-to-market interest costs (EBCRLV) [TR-ND-081]
          COUNT(*) AS t33,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCRLV IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f33,
          -- FEFWBTP-034: Missing Current Total Funding Cost on Provision (EBCIEC) [TR-ND-082]
          COUNT(*) AS t34,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCIEC IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f34,
          -- FEFWBTP-035: Missing Current Total Amortisation of premium/discount (EBCAPD) [TR-ND-083]
          COUNT(*) AS t35,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCAPD IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f35,
          -- FEFWBTP-036: Missing Current Total Amortisation of premium/discount for (EBCOPD) [TR-ND-084]
          COUNT(*) AS t36,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCOPD IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f36,
          -- FEFWBTP-037: Missing Previous change in Premium/Discount (EBPPDS) [TR-ND-085]
          COUNT(*) AS t37,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPPDS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f37,
          -- FEFWBTP-038: Missing Previous NPV of change in Premium/Discount (EBPPDI) [TR-ND-086]
          COUNT(*) AS t38,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPPDI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f38,
          -- FEFWBTP-039: Missing Previous Mark-to-market interest costs (EBPMMI) [TR-ND-087]
          COUNT(*) AS t39,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPMMI IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f39,
          -- FEFWBTP-040: Missing Previous NPV of Mark-to-market Interest costs (EBPRLV) [TR-ND-088]
          COUNT(*) AS t40,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPRLV IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f40,
          -- FEFWBTP-041: Missing Previous Total Funding Cost on Provision (EBPINT) [TR-ND-089]
          COUNT(*) AS t41,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPINT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f41,
          -- FEFWBTP-042: Missing Previous Total Amortisation of premium/discount (EBPAPD) [TR-ND-090]
          COUNT(*) AS t42,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPAPD IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f42,
          -- FEFWBTP-043: Missing Previous Total Amortisation of premium/discount fo (EBPOPD) [TR-ND-091]
          COUNT(*) AS t43,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBPOPD IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f43,
          -- FEFWBTP-044: Missing Option Pricing Indicator (EBOPIN) [TR-ND-092]
          COUNT(*) AS t44,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBOPIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EBOPIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f44,
          -- FEFWBTP-045: Missing Customer Margin (EBCMGN) [TR-ND-093]
          COUNT(*) AS t45,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCMGN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f45,
          -- FEFWBTP-046: Invalid/Missing Capture Date (EBCDAT) [TR-ND-094]
          COUNT(*) AS t46,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCDAT IS NULL OR EBCDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f46,
          -- FEFWBTP-047: Invalid/Missing Deal Date (EBDDAT) [TR-ND-095]
          COUNT(*) AS t47,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBDDAT IS NULL OR EBDDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f47,
          -- FEFWBTP-048: Invalid/Missing Ladder Value Date (EBLVDA) [TR-ND-096]
          COUNT(*) AS t48,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBLVDA IS NULL OR EBLVDA NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f48,
          -- FEFWBTP-049: Invalid/Missing Option End Date (EBEDAT) [TR-ND-097]
          COUNT(*) AS t49,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBEDAT IS NULL OR EBEDAT NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f49,
          -- FEFWBTP-050: Invalid/Missing Spot Date of Contract (EBSPTD) [TR-ND-098]
          COUNT(*) AS t50,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBSPTD IS NULL OR EBSPTD NOT BETWEEN 19900101 AND 20991231 THEN 1 END) AS f50,
          -- FEFWBTP-051: Same primary and counter currency (EBCYPC = EBCYCC) [TR-ND-099]
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCYPC IS NOT NULL AND EBCYCC IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END) AS t51,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EBCYPC = EBCYCC THEN 1 END) AS f51
        FROM DATACUT5."TREATS_FEFWBTP"
      )
      UNPIVOT ((total, failed) FOR check_key IN (
        (t1, f1) AS 'FEFWBTP-001|Missing Data|Missing Country Code (EBCTYC) [TR-ND-049]',
        (t2, f2) AS 'FEFWBTP-002|Missing Data|Missing Group Member Abbreviation (EBGMAB) [TR-ND-050]',
        (t3, f3) AS 'FEFWBTP-003|Missing Data|Missing Branch Number (EBBRNO) [TR-ND-051]',
        (t4, f4) AS 'FEFWBTP-004|Missing Data|Missing Dealing Number (EBDLNO) [TR-ND-052]',
        (t5, f5) AS 'FEFWBTP-005|Missing Data|Missing Associated Deal Number (EBASDN) [TR-ND-053]',
        (t6, f6) AS 'FEFWBTP-006|Missing Data|Missing Origination of Deal Indicator (EBODIN) [TR-ND-054]',
        (t7, f7) AS 'FEFWBTP-007|Missing Data|Missing Cancel Flag (EBCNFG) [TR-ND-055]',
        (t8, f8) AS 'FEFWBTP-008|Missing Data|Missing Profit Centre Mnemonic (EBPCTR) [TR-ND-056]',
        (t9, f9) AS 'FEFWBTP-009|Missing Data|Missing Sub-Profit Centre (EBSPCT) [TR-ND-057]',
        (t10, f10) AS 'FEFWBTP-010|Missing Data|Missing Trading Group Identifier (EBTDGP) [TR-ND-058]',
        (t11, f11) AS 'FEFWBTP-011|Missing Data|Missing Trading Pool Identifier (EBTDPL) [TR-ND-059]',
        (t12, f12) AS 'FEFWBTP-012|Missing Data|Missing Dealing Position Number (EBDPOS) [TR-ND-060]',
        (t13, f13) AS 'FEFWBTP-013|Missing Data|Missing Account Product Type (EBAPTY) [TR-ND-061]',
        (t14, f14) AS 'FEFWBTP-014|Missing Data|Missing Accounting Flag (EBACFG) [TR-ND-062]',
        (t15, f15) AS 'FEFWBTP-015|Missing Data|Missing Ext/Int/Retail/Arbitrage Indicator (EBEIRI) [TR-ND-063]',
        (t16, f16) AS 'FEFWBTP-016|Missing Data|Missing Counterparty Acronym (EBCPAC) [TR-ND-064]',
        (t17, f17) AS 'FEFWBTP-017|Missing Data|Missing GHO Customer Classification (EBGCCL) [TR-ND-065]',
        (t18, f18) AS 'FEFWBTP-018|Missing Data|Missing Primary Currency (EBCYPC) [TR-ND-066]',
        (t19, f19) AS 'FEFWBTP-019|Missing Data|Missing Counter Currency (EBCYCC) [TR-ND-067]',
        (t20, f20) AS 'FEFWBTP-020|Missing Data|Missing Primary Currency Contract Amount (EBPCYA) [TR-ND-068]',
        (t21, f21) AS 'FEFWBTP-021|Missing Data|Missing Counter Currency Contract Amount (EBCCYA) [TR-ND-069]',
        (t22, f22) AS 'FEFWBTP-022|Missing Data|Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Spot Equiv. Rate (EBPCCS) [TR-ND-070]',
        (t23, f23) AS 'FEFWBTP-023|Missing Data|Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Swap Points (EBPCSS) [TR-ND-071]',
        (t24, f24) AS 'FEFWBTP-024|Missing Data|Missing Primary/Counter Currency Contract Swap Points from (EBPCSE) [TR-ND-072]',
        (t25, f25) AS 'FEFWBTP-025|Missing Data|Missing Primary Currency Contract Interest Rate (EBPCYI) [TR-ND-073]',
        (t26, f26) AS 'FEFWBTP-026|Missing Data|Missing Counter Currency Contract Interest Rate (EBCCYI) [TR-ND-074]',
        (t27, f27) AS 'FEFWBTP-027|Missing Data|Missing Primary Currency Discounted Amount (EBPCYD) [TR-ND-075]',
        (t28, f28) AS 'FEFWBTP-028|Missing Data|Missing Counter Currency Discounted Amount (EBCCYD) [TR-ND-076]',
        (t29, f29) AS 'FEFWBTP-029|Missing Data|Missing Rate Sense (EBRSNS) [TR-ND-077]',
        (t30, f30) AS 'FEFWBTP-030|Missing Data|Missing Current change in Premium/Discount (EBCPDS) [TR-ND-078]',
        (t31, f31) AS 'FEFWBTP-031|Missing Data|Missing Current NPV of change in Premium/Discount (EBCPDI) [TR-ND-079]',
        (t32, f32) AS 'FEFWBTP-032|Missing Data|Missing Current Mark-to-market interest costs (EBCMMI) [TR-ND-080]',
        (t33, f33) AS 'FEFWBTP-033|Missing Data|Missing Current NPV of Mark-to-market interest costs (EBCRLV) [TR-ND-081]',
        (t34, f34) AS 'FEFWBTP-034|Missing Data|Missing Current Total Funding Cost on Provision (EBCIEC) [TR-ND-082]',
        (t35, f35) AS 'FEFWBTP-035|Missing Data|Missing Current Total Amortisation of premium/discount (EBCAPD) [TR-ND-083]',
        (t36, f36) AS 'FEFWBTP-036|Missing Data|Missing Current Total Amortisation of premium/discount for (EBCOPD) [TR-ND-084]',
        (t37, f37) AS 'FEFWBTP-037|Missing Data|Missing Previous change in Premium/Discount (EBPPDS) [TR-ND-085]',
        (t38, f38) AS 'FEFWBTP-038|Missing Data|Missing Previous NPV of change in Premium/Discount (EBPPDI) [TR-ND-086]',
        (t39, f39) AS 'FEFWBTP-039|Missing Data|Missing Previous Mark-to-market interest costs (EBPMMI) [TR-ND-087]',
        (t40, f40) AS 'FEFWBTP-040|Missing Data|Missing Previous NPV of Mark-to-market Interest costs (EBPRLV) [TR-ND-088]',
        (t41, f41) AS 'FEFWBTP-041|Missing Data|Missing Previous Total Funding Cost on Provision (EBPINT) [TR-ND-089]',
        (t42, f42) AS 'FEFWBTP-042|Missing Data|Missing Previous Total Amortisation of premium/discount (EBPAPD) [TR-ND-090]',
        (t43, f43) AS 'FEFWBTP-043|Missing Data|Missing Previous Total Amortisation of premium/discount fo (EBPOPD) [TR-ND-091]',
        (t44, f44) AS 'FEFWBTP-044|Missing Data|Missing Option Pricing Indicator (EBOPIN) [TR-ND-092]',
        (t45, f45) AS 'FEFWBTP-045|Missing Data|Missing Customer Margin (EBCMGN) [TR-ND-093]',
        (t46, f46) AS 'FEFWBTP-046|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Capture Date (EBCDAT) [TR-ND-094]',
        (t47, f47) AS 'FEFWBTP-047|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Deal Date (EBDDAT) [TR-ND-095]',
        (t48, f48) AS 'FEFWBTP-048|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Ladder Value Date (EBLVDA) [TR-ND-096]',
        (t49, f49) AS 'FEFWBTP-049|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Option End Date (EBEDAT) [TR-ND-097]',
        (t50, f50) AS 'FEFWBTP-050|Invalid Dates|Invalid/Missing Spot Date of Contract (EBSPTD) [TR-ND-098]',
        (t51, f51) AS 'FEFWBTP-051|Inconsistent Data|Same primary and counter currency (EBCYPC = EBCYCC) [TR-ND-099]'
      ))
    UNION ALL
/* =============================================================================
   MMSWBTP - Money Market SWAP/MCNNI Blotter
   Πίνακας: DATACUT5."TREATS_MMSWBTP"   Shadow: δεν υπάρχει mode flag   Έλεγχοι: 126
   Έλεγχοι του DC4 (νέοι τύποι deals του DD v2.0): TR-ND-101..226.
   Στο DD ο πίνακας λέγεται "TEUTTSFP_MMSWBTP"· στη βάση TREATS_MMSWBTP.
   ============================================================================= */
    SELECT 'MMSWBTP - Money Market SWAP/MCNNI Blotter' AS table_name, check_key, total, failed
      FROM (
        SELECT
          -- MMSWBTP-001: Missing Country Code (EPCTYC) [TR-ND-101]
          COUNT(*) AS t1,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCTYC IS NULL OR TRIM(EPCTYC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f1,
          -- MMSWBTP-002: Missing Group Member Abbreviation (EPGMAB) [TR-ND-102]
          COUNT(*) AS t2,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPGMAB IS NULL OR TRIM(EPGMAB) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f2,
          -- MMSWBTP-003: Missing Branch Number (EPBRNO) [TR-ND-103]
          COUNT(*) AS t3,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPBRNO IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f3,
          -- MMSWBTP-004: Missing Dealing Number (EPDLNO) [TR-ND-104]
          COUNT(*) AS t4,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPDLNO IS NULL OR TRIM(EPDLNO) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f4,
          -- MMSWBTP-005: Missing Pay/Recieve Indicator (EPPRIN) [TR-ND-105]
          COUNT(*) AS t5,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPRIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPPRIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f5,
          -- MMSWBTP-006: Missing Account Product Type (EPAPTY) [TR-ND-106]
          COUNT(*) AS t6,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPAPTY IS NULL OR TRIM(EPAPTY) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f6,
          -- MMSWBTP-007: Missing Counterparty Acronym (EPCPAC) [TR-ND-107]
          COUNT(*) AS t7,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCPAC IS NULL OR TRIM(EPCPAC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f7,
          -- MMSWBTP-008: Missing Product Currency (EPPDCY) [TR-ND-108]
          COUNT(*) AS t8,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPDCY IS NULL OR TRIM(EPPDCY) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f8,
          -- MMSWBTP-009: Missing Product Group (EPPRDG) [TR-ND-109]
          COUNT(*) AS t9,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPRDG IS NULL OR TRIM(EPPRDG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f9,
          -- MMSWBTP-010: Missing GHO Customer Classification (EPGHOC) [TR-ND-110]
          COUNT(*) AS t10,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPGHOC IS NULL OR TRIM(EPGHOC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f10,
          -- MMSWBTP-011: Missing Ext/Int/Retail/Arbitrage Indicator (EPEIRI) [TR-ND-111]
          COUNT(*) AS t11,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPEIRI IS NULL OR TRIM(EPEIRI) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f11,
          -- MMSWBTP-012: Missing Asset/Liability Indicator (EPALIN) [TR-ND-112]
          COUNT(*) AS t12,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPALIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPALIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f12,
          -- MMSWBTP-013: Missing On/Off Balance Sheet Indicator (EPPNIN) [TR-ND-113]
          COUNT(*) AS t13,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPNIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPPNIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f13,
          -- MMSWBTP-014: Missing Fixed/Floating Indicator (EPXOIN) [TR-ND-114]
          COUNT(*) AS t14,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPXOIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPXOIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f14,
          -- MMSWBTP-015: Missing Hedging/Trading Indicator (EPHTIN) [TR-ND-115]
          COUNT(*) AS t15,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPHTIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPHTIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f15,
          -- MMSWBTP-016: Missing Match/Unmatch Indicator (EPMUIN) [TR-ND-116]
          COUNT(*) AS t16,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPMUIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPMUIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f16,
          -- MMSWBTP-017: Missing Profit Centre Mnemonic (EPPCTR) [TR-ND-117]
          COUNT(*) AS t17,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPCTR IS NULL OR TRIM(EPPCTR) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f17,
          -- MMSWBTP-018: Missing Sub-Profit Centre (EPSPCT) [TR-ND-118]
          COUNT(*) AS t18,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPSPCT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f18,
          -- MMSWBTP-019: Missing Dealing Position Number (EPDPOS) [TR-ND-119]
          COUNT(*) AS t19,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPDPOS IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f19,
          -- MMSWBTP-020: Missing Floating Rate Type (EPORTY) [TR-ND-120]
          COUNT(*) AS t20,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPORTY IS NULL OR TRIM(EPORTY) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f20,
          -- MMSWBTP-021: Missing Floating Rate Periodicity (EPORPT) [TR-ND-121]
          COUNT(*) AS t21,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPORPT IS NULL OR TRIM(EPORPT) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f21,
          -- MMSWBTP-022: Missing Initial/Final Exchange Flag (EPIFEX) [TR-ND-122]
          COUNT(*) AS t22,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPIFEX IS NULL OR TRIM(EPIFEX) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f22,
          -- MMSWBTP-023: Missing Accounting Flag (EPACFG) [TR-ND-123]
          COUNT(*) AS t23,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPACFG IS NULL OR TRIM(EPACFG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f23,
          -- MMSWBTP-024: Missing Cancel Flag (EPCNFG) [TR-ND-124]
          COUNT(*) AS t24,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCNFG IS NULL OR TRIM(EPCNFG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f24,
          -- MMSWBTP-025: Missing Terminated Indicator (EPTEIN) [TR-ND-125]
          COUNT(*) AS t25,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPTEIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPTEIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f25,
          -- MMSWBTP-026: Missing Special Cashflow Indicator (EPSCIN) [TR-ND-126]
          COUNT(*) AS t26,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPSCIN IS NULL OR TRIM(EPSCIN) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f26,
          -- MMSWBTP-027: Missing Amortizing Indicator (EPAMTZ) [TR-ND-127]
          COUNT(*) AS t27,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPAMTZ IS NULL OR TRIM(EPAMTZ) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f27,
          -- MMSWBTP-028: Missing Constant Fixed Rate (EPCXRT) [TR-ND-128]
          COUNT(*) AS t28,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCXRT IS NULL OR TRIM(EPCXRT) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f28,
          -- MMSWBTP-029: Missing Interest Calculation method (EPINTC) [TR-ND-129]
          COUNT(*) AS t29,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPINTC IS NULL OR TRIM(EPINTC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f29,
          -- MMSWBTP-030: Missing Yield Curve ID (EPYLDC) [TR-ND-130]
          COUNT(*) AS t30,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPYLDC IS NULL OR TRIM(EPYLDC) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f30,
          -- MMSWBTP-031: Missing Projecting Curve (EPPJCV) [TR-ND-131]
          COUNT(*) AS t31,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPJCV IS NULL OR TRIM(EPPJCV) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f31,
          -- MMSWBTP-032: Missing Projected Flag (Y/N) (EPPJFG) [TR-ND-132]
          COUNT(*) AS t32,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPJFG IS NULL OR TRIM(EPPJFG) IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f32,
          -- MMSWBTP-033: Missing Interest Rate (EPIRAT) [TR-ND-133]
          COUNT(*) AS t33,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPIRAT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f33,
          -- MMSWBTP-034: Missing Quoted Margin (EPQMRG) [TR-ND-134]
          COUNT(*) AS t34,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPQMRG IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f34,
          -- MMSWBTP-035: Missing Corporate Margin (EPMRGN) [TR-ND-135]
          COUNT(*) AS t35,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPMRGN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f35,
          -- MMSWBTP-036: Missing Mark-to-market rate (EPMMRT) [TR-ND-136]
          COUNT(*) AS t36,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPMMRT IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f36,
          -- MMSWBTP-037: Missing Money Market Dsicount Factor (EPMMDF) [TR-ND-137]
          COUNT(*) AS t37,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPMMDF IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f37,
          -- MMSWBTP-038: Missing Duration of Term in number of days (EPDRTM) [TR-ND-138]
          COUNT(*) AS t38,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPDRTM IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f38,
          -- MMSWBTP-039: Missing Time Of Creation/Amendment (EPTMCA) [TR-ND-139]
          COUNT(*) AS t39,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPTMCA IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f39,
          -- MMSWBTP-040: Missing Principal/Carrying Value (EPPRCP) [TR-ND-140]
          COUNT(*) AS t40,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPRCP IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f40,
          -- MMSWBTP-041: Missing Principal as at Last Processing Date (EPPRCL) [TR-ND-141]
          COUNT(*) AS t41,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPRCL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f41,
          -- MMSWBTP-042: Missing Principal as at Next Processing Date (EPPRCN) [TR-ND-142]
          COUNT(*) AS t42,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPPRCN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f42,
          -- MMSWBTP-043: Missing Real principal exchanged to LPD (EPRPEL) [TR-ND-143]
          COUNT(*) AS t43,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPRPEL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f43,
          -- MMSWBTP-044: Missing Real Principal exchanged to NPD (EPRPEN) [TR-ND-144]
          COUNT(*) AS t44,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPRPEN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f44,
          -- MMSWBTP-045: Missing Highest Outstanding Principal - LPD (EPHOPL) [TR-ND-145]
          COUNT(*) AS t45,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPHOPL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f45,
          -- MMSWBTP-046: Missing Highest Outstanding Principal - NPD (EPHOPN) [TR-ND-146]
          COUNT(*) AS t46,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPHOPN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f46,
          -- MMSWBTP-047: Missing Coupon P and L to LPD (EPCPPL) [TR-ND-147]
          COUNT(*) AS t47,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCPPL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f47,
          -- MMSWBTP-048: Missing Coupon P and L to NPD (EPCPPN) [TR-ND-148]
          COUNT(*) AS t48,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCPPN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f48,
          -- MMSWBTP-049: Missing Corporate Margin earned to LPD (EPCMEL) [TR-ND-149]
          COUNT(*) AS t49,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCMEL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f49,
          -- MMSWBTP-050: Missing Corporate Margin Earned to NPD (EPCMEN) [TR-ND-150]
          COUNT(*) AS t50,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPCMEN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f50,
          -- MMSWBTP-051: Missing Special Cash Settled LPD (EPSCSL) [TR-ND-151]
          COUNT(*) AS t51,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPSCSL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f51,
          -- MMSWBTP-052: Missing Special Cash Settled NPD (EPSCSN) [TR-ND-152]
          COUNT(*) AS t52,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPSCSN IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f52,
          -- MMSWBTP-053: Missing Accrued Interest to LPD (EPINTL) [TR-ND-153]
          COUNT(*) AS t53,
          COUNT(CASE WHEN EPINTL IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS f53,
          -- MMSWBTP-054: Missing Accrued Interest to NPD (EPINTN) [TR-ND-154]
          COUNT(*) AS t54,
